<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Matthew</book>
  <para style="h">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matthew</para>
  <para style="mt">Matthew</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham ii suan, David ii tu le ta ahi, Jesus Christ ii taanghpupite ii min tepteena lai sia hi bang hi a, Abraham pan David kumpipa dong, a taanghpupite ii minte a nuai a bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham ta Isaac, Isaac ta Jacob, Jacob ta Judah le a suapuite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah in a zi Tamar taw Perez le Zerah hing a, Perez ta Hezron, Hezron ta Ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ram ta Amminadab, Amminadab ta Nahshon, Nahshon ta Salmon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salmon ta Boaz hi. Boaz ii nu sia Rahab ahi hi. Boaz in a zi Ruth taw Obed hing a Obed ta Jesse hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesse ta sia David Kumpipa ahi hi. David pan Babylon khua ah Israel mite salin a kimat hun dong, a nuai a bangin taanghpupite khang kiciamtee hi. David in Uriah zi taw Solomon hing a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon ta Rehoboam, Rehoboam ta Abijah, Abijah ta Asa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa ta Jehoshaphat, Jehoshaphat ta Jehoram, Jehoram ta Uzziah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uzziah ta Jotham, Jotham ta Ahaz, Ahaz ta Hezekiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiah ta Manasseh, Manasseh ta Amon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amon ta Josiah, Josiah ta Jehoiachin le a suapuite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babylon ah salin a kiciapui pan kipan Jesus khang dong a nuai a bangin taanghpupite khang kiciamtee hi. Jehoiachin ta Shealtiel, Shealtiel ta Zerubbabel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zerubbabel ta Abiud, Abiud ta Eliakim, Eliakim ta Azor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azor ta Zadok, Zadok ta Achim, Achim ta Eliud,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eliud ta Eleazar, Eleazar ta Matthan, Matthan ta Jacob,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jacob ta Joseph hi a, Christ kici Jesus Nu Mary pasal ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom Abraham khang panin David khang dong khang sawm le khang li hi a, David khang pan Babylon ah salin a kipaipui uh dong khang sawm le khang li, Babylon te mat hun pan Messiah sua dong khang sawm le khang li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesus Christ suana sia hi bang ahi hi. A nu Mary sia Joseph taw teang tu in a kidongh sa ahi hi. Ahihang a kiteen uh ma in, ama Thaa Thiangtho taw naungil om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joseph sia thumaan a ngamta tawntung pa khat hi a, ahizong ngual mai ah Mary maimawlsak nuam ngawl ahikom amate nii bek vaihawm in kikhen sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuabangin a ngaisut laitakin, Vantunglalang khat a mang sungah hong kilak a “David ii suan Joseph awng, Mary sia na zi tu in teenpui kiita heak in. Banghang ziam cile ama sia Thaa Thiangtho in ngaisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in tapa khat hong hing tu a, a min Jesus ci in na phuak tu hi — banghang ziam cile ama in a mite mawna pan a hun tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tu in hite theampo a pianna sia Topa kamsaangpa sonkhol teng a taangtun natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngaknu thiangtho khat naungil om tu a, tapa khat hing tu hi, a min Immanuel kiphuak tu hi.” (Tua in “Eite taw Pathian omkhawm hi,” a cinopna hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joseph khanglo in vantunglalang ii sawl bangma in Mary teenpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang taciil nau a sua dong a zi ompui ngawl hi. Tuaciang Joseph in nau min Jesus ci in phuak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus sia Herod Kumpipa maan lai in, Judea ngam Bethlehem khua ah suak hi. Tua zawk hai ngawlin aksi huvau a kante in nisuana sang pan Jerusalem ah hong pai uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Jew te Kumpipa tu in a piang nausen sia koisung a suak ziam,” ci in dongh hi. “Nisuana sang panin ama ii aksi hong suak ka mu uh a, ama bia tu in kong pai uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Herod Kumpipa in hi thu a zaak ciang, Jerusalem a om midangte bangma in liinglawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in thiampi liante theampo le Thukham hil sya theampo kaikhawm in, “Messiah koisungah suak tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Judea ngam Bethlehem khua ah suak tu hi, banghang ziam cile kamsaang khat in hi bangin at zo hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Judah ngam Bethlehem khua awng Judah ngam khuapi thupite sungah, nang sia a nobel na hi bua hi, banghang ziam cile nang sung panin, ka Israel mite lam a lak tu lampuipa khat, hong piang tu hi.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom Herod in nisuana sang pan hong pai leangnate sam ku a, aksi a kilangh bang hun tatak ziam, ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang, hi bang sawlna taw Bethlehem ah paisak hi. “Pai tavun a, patangno sia pha tak hong zong tavun. Na mu zawk uh ciang hong zasak kik tavun, kei zongh pai in ka bia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang amate ding kik a, nisuana sang pan a mu sa uh aksi sia ma a pai kawmin mu uh hi. Amate in tua aksi a mu ciangin, a thinnopna le a lungdamna kison zo ngawl hi! Aksi sia amate mai ah pai a patangno omna tung san a thet ciang tawlnga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate inn sungah tum a patangno le a nu Mary a mu uh ciang khupdin in bia uh hi. Amate in a ken uh a letsongte khamh, frankincense paaknamtui le myrrh thil namtuite sua in pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian in amate Herod kungah, a heak kik ngawl natu in, a mang sungah hilkhol ahikom lampi dang khat tawn in, a ngam ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate a pai zawkciang, Topa vantunglalang khat Joseph mang sungah kilangh a, “Herod in patangno sia that tu in zong tu hi. Tua ahikom patangno le a nu Egypt ngam ah taipui ta'n, cia kik a kong sawl dong, tua munah om tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joseph tho a patangno le a nu Egypt ngam ah zan lai in, taipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua munah Herod thi dong taam uh hi. “Egypt ngam pan ka Tapa ka sam hi,” ci thu kamsaangpa ii sonkholnate a taangtunna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nisuana sang pan hong pai mihing pilte in theam ahi hunlam Herod in a phaw ciangin a thin uuk mama hi. Bethlehem khua sung le a kiim a paam a om, kum nii le a nuaisia patangno theampo thalup tu in thupia hi. Mipilte ii aksi a mu hun taw tuatin tuabangin ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kamsaangpa Jeremiah ii a sonkholna teng hi bangin taangtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ramah ngam ah nasia tak kaana awnging khat kiza hi. Rachel sia a tate a thi siat hu in kiheneam zo ngawlin kap hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Herod thi zawkciang Egypt ngam a om Joseph mang sungah Topa vantunglalang khat kilangh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tho in nauno le a nu, Israel ngam ah ciapui kik ta'n. Banghang ziam cile patang a that nuam sia thi zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom Joseph tho a, nauno le a nu taw Israel ngam ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Judea ngam ah Herod za a laih sia Archelaus hi, ci in Joseph in a zaak ciang tua ngam a pai tu lau hi. A mang sungah a ngamtat natu kihil thua ahikom Galilee ngam ah pai in Nazareth khua ah teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kamsaangte sonkhol bangin, “Ama sia Nazareth mi kici tu hi,” a cina thu taangtung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Tuiphumpa John sia Judea sennealngam ah hong pai a, thuhil kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na mawna uh pan kisiik kik vun, banghang ziam cile Vantung ngam hong nai zo hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kamsaangpa Isaiah kammal sia John huvau a sonkholna hi a, “Sennealngam sungah mihing khat hong taangko a, ‘Topa atu in lampi pua khol vun; Ama ii khualhaw natu in lamzin tang khat vawtsak vun!’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />John ii puansilh sia kalaoh mul taw kitak a, ama in savun kawngkhau thua in, ama an sia khaumaw le ngam khuaitui ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihingte in Jerusalem pan, Judea ngamkhen bup le Jordan ngunhui ngam theampo panin hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a mawna uh pualaak a, tuaciangin Jordan ngun sungah ama in tuiphum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pharisee te le Sadducee te tam ma ama kungah tui kiphum tu in, hong pai a mu ciangin, amate tungah, “No ngul ngilote awng — Pathian ii daan hong piak natu panin suakta tu nu hi ci in akua in hong son ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mawna pan kisii kikna lim kilanghsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na taanghpupi Abraham suan le paalte na hi uh hu in, daan thuak natu pan suakta tu in, kimuangmaw heak vun. No tungah hong ci khi hi, Pathian in hi suangte zongh la in Abraham suan le paalte suaksak thei hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thingkungte phuk tu in a bul ah, heimai kingat zo hi, ngapha a nga ngawl thingkung theampo kiphuk tu a, meimang sungah kisep tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kisii kikna uh a kitel natu in tui kong phum hi, ahihang kei nung pan hong pai lai tu pa in no sia Thaa Thiangtho le meikuang taw hong baptize tu hi. Kei sangin ama lian zaw pek a, a peangdap toai tu zonghin ka kilawm bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in taangkheaplaw a khut sungah toai zo hi. Zungtaangte hong kheap tu a taangtang teng taangsaal sungah khawmtua in, taangsi taangvai teng a mit ngeingawl meikuang sungah hal tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Galilee pan Jesus hong theng a, John ii tuiphum tu in, Jordan ngun, John kungah hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang John in ama tho tu in kithoai a, “Kei sia nangma ii nong tuiphum tu hizaw napi, kei kungah nang hong paizaw ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in zo kik a “Pathian ii deina theampo a kicin natu in, tu in hong seam ta'n,” ci hi. Tuaciang John zongh thukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesus tui a kiphum zawk po ciang tui sung pan hong pusuak to hi. Tuaciang ama atu van kihong a, Pathian ii Thaa ngam vakhu bangin hong tuaksuk in, ama tungah hong tusuk a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang van panin aw khat in, “Hisia in ka it ka Tapa hi a, ama tungah ka lungkim hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Thaa in Jesus sia Doaimangpa ii ze et tu in ngam sungah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sun sawmli le zan sawmli an ne ngawlin a om zawkciang Jesus ngilkial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Doaimangpa hong pai a, “Pathian Tapa na hi le suang hite anluum suaksak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in zo a, “Laithiangtho in, ‘Mihingte sia anluum bek taw nungta thei hi ngawl a, Pathian kam sung pan a pusuak kammal khat sim nuntak pui hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Doaimangpa in Jesus sia Khuapi Thiangtho Jerusalem ah paipui a, Biakinn khuvum a saangbel na ah suanhto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Pathian Tapa na hile nangma le nangma kitaaksuksak in, banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in ci hi, ‘Pathian in a vantunglalangte nang huvau in sawl tu a, na peang beak zongh suang taw a kisutha ngawl natu in, a khut taw hong domto tu hi.’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesus in, “Ahihang laithiangtho in, ‘Na Topa Pathian na ze et heak vun,’ zongh ci si hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang Doaimangpa in mualsaang mama khat ii tungah paipui a, leitung ngam tuatuamte ii letna theampo lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Khupdin in kei hong bia lete, hi teng theampo nang kong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Jesus in, “Satan awng, tai in! Laithiangtho in, ‘Na Topa Pathian bek bia vun a, Ama atu bek sepsak vun!’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, Doaimangpa in Jesus nusia a, vantung mite hong pai in Jesus ou uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesus in John thong sungah kikhum hi, ci in a zaak ciang, ama Galilee ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama Nazareth khua ah taam ngawlin, Zebulun le Naphtali ngamsung Galilee tuili hui khuapi Capernaum ah teang tu in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi bang a ngamtat sia, kamsaangpa Isaiah pauna teng a taangtun natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Zebulun ngam le Naphtali ngam, Tuipi sung zotna lampi tung, Jordan ngun lang khat, Galilee, Gentile te ngam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuazing sungah a teang mihingte in, Khuavak taang lian mama khat mu tu hi. Thina khuazing ngamsung a teangte tungah khuavak a taang tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua hun pan kipan Jesus in, “Na mawna uh pan kisiik kik vun, banghang ziam cile Vantung ngam hong nai zo hi,” ci in ama thuhilnate hil tu in a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Galilee tuili hui ah a va laitakin, Jesus in ngasa mante ahi unau nii Simon (Peter kici) le a suapuipa Andrew, tuili sungah ngeen khat taw ngasa manin a om mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesus in amate tungah, “Hong zui tavun, mihing mante kong suaksak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thakhatin a ngeente nusia uh a, ama zui paih uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua mun pan a paisuak uh ciang Zebedee tapate unau James le John mu hi. Amate in a pa taw ngunkuang sungah a ngeente puua in om uh hi. Jesus in amate sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thakhatin a ngunkuang le a pa nusia in zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesus Galilee ngam bup ah vakin, synagogue te ah hilna nei a, Kumpingam Lungdamna Thu thuhilna nei in, natna satna namcin le ciluang natna a neite damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama thu sia Syria ngam bup ah kizel ahikom mihingte in ama kungah ciina theampo, natna satna le mealhem theampo: doai veite, butthi theite, langngawte, paipui in — Jesus in damsak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galilee ngam khuapi sawmte le Jerusalem, Judea le Jordan ngunngal panin, mihonte in zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in mihonpite a mu ciangin mual tungah kaato hi. A nungzuite a kiim ah kikhawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang amate tungah hil tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thaa thu ah a zawngkhal hunlam a kihete in, mihing lungdamte ahi hi; Vantung ngam sia amate aa ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“A thuum a taute in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi! Pathian in amate heeneam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“A kiniamkhiakte in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi; amate in Pathian kamciamte a saang tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Pathian ii tangkalte sep tu a lungngulbel te in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi; Pathian in a kicing lungkimna pia tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ngual hesuak theite in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi; Pathian in amate hesuak tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Thinsung thiangthote in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi; amate in Pathian mu tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kilemna a vawtte in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi; Pathian in ka tate ci tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Pathian ii deina bang ngamtatna hangin vawtsiat a thuakte in, mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi; Vantung ngam in amate aa hi tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kei nungzui na hi uh hu in ngual in hong zawngsak hong vawtsia in, ngitlo leilot thu a nanam taw mawna hong zong le mihing lungdamte na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na thinnuamsak vun, lungdam vun, banghang ziam cile vantung ah na thaman saan tu hong kikoisak sia lian mama hi. Taanghlai kamsaangte zongh tuabang ma in, na kivawtsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mihingte atu in no sia ci taw na kibang uh hi. Ahihang ci sia a alna a thai le ki alsak kik thei nawn ngawl hi. Tua in kimanna nei nawn ngawl a, kivawkin, mihingte in tuanhcil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“No sia leitung bup atu in khuavak taw na kibang uh hi. Mualtung ah a kisa khuapi sia a kiseal thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mei a det ciang, kuama in kuang taw sincip ngeingawl hi. Inn sung a om theampo a taan natu mun meivakna tungah kikoi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in, napha na sep uhte mihingte in a mu ciang, vantung a om na Pa uh a pok natu in, amate mai ah na khuavak uh taangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Moses thukham le kamsaangte hilnate bosak tu in hong pai hong sa heak vun. A bosak tu hong pai hi ngawlin, a khuangkhimsak tu in hong pai ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na theampo ii tawp natu a khuangkhim mateng, simlei le vanpi a kip laiteng, thukham sung a thu nobel khat zongh a bo thong buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom, a kuama po thupiakte sung pan a nobel khat ni ngawlin midang zongh tuabangin a nit ngawl natu a hil sia in Vantung ngam sungah a nobel hi tu hi. Tuaciangin a kuama po ahizong thukham ni a, midangte zongh tuabangin a nit natu a hil sia Vantung ngam sungah lian tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tatakin kong ciciang, Pathian ii deina bang na vawtna sungah Thukham hil Syate le Pharisee te sangin na thumaan zaw uh le bekin Vantung ngam sungah na tum thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mihing na that uh le thusitna na thuak tu hi. ‘Mihing na that heak vun,’ ci in taanghlaite kihilna sia na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang tu in kong ci in ah: a suapuipa tungah a thin uuk pawpo te in thusitna thuak tu hi, a kuama po ahizong a suapuipa ngina ngawl hi, a ci peuma, Council te mai ah kipaipui tu a, a kuama po a suapuipa mannung ngawl mihing mawmaw, a ci peuma hell meikuang sungah a pai tu lauhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom biaknatau tungah biakpiakna nei tu in, na kithoai laitakin, na suapuipa in, nang tungah lungkim ngawlna nei hi, ci in na phawk le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />na piak tu vanh sia biaknatau mai ah nusia phot zii ta'n a, na suapuipa taw kilemna vawt phot ta'n, tua zawkciang hong pai kik ta'n a, Pathian tungah biakpiakna nei pheang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Khat po in thu hong vawt a, zumkong hong then le a hun om lai, zum na thet ma in, na kituu uh thu sia saatmit masa tavun. Tua ahibuale ama in thukhenmangte tungah hong then tu a, tuate in palikte munah hong aapin, thonginn sungah hong khum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A maan tatak kong ci ciangin, tua na liausum teng a cingin na piak siat mateng thonginn sung pan na suakta thei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“ ‘Nupa kipalngul heak vun’ ci thu na za zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu in hi bangin kong ci hi: khat po in numei khat khialpui nopna thin taw a en le a thinsung ah nupa palngul khialna vawt hi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahikom na mit ziatsang in hong mawsak le khelkeak in vawk in! hell sungah na pumpi bup in na pai sangin, pumpi cing ngawlin, om lete phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na khut ziat sangin hong khialsak le, saattan in vawk in. Na pumpi cingin hell sungah na pai sangin, khutsamh peangsamh in om lete phazaw pek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“ ‘A zi a khul mihing khat pawpo in kikhulna lai pia tahen,’ kici si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahihang tu in kong ci in ah: a zi ii thumaan ngawlna simngawl thudang taw pasal khat in a zi khul a, tua nu in pasal dang khat a nei kik le, nupa palngul mawna a vawtsak suak hi. A pasal kik sia zongh in, nupa palngul mawna vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“ ‘Na kamciam vawtte ciampeal heak vun. Topa tungah vawt tu a na kamciamnate uh na vawt vun,’ ci in khangluite tungah a kison thute na heaksa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahihang tu in kong cina panin: kamciam na kipiak uh ciangin kiciamna zangh heak vun. Vantung min lo in na kiciam heak vun, banghang ziam cile tua in Pathian tokhum ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />leitung taw zong kiciam heak vun, banghang ziam cile tua in a peang ngakna ahi hi; Jerusalem min lo in zongh kiciam heak vun, banghang ziam cile tua in Kumpilianpa khuapi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na lutang taw zonghin na kiciam heak in, banghang ziam cile na samzam khat a kaang tu le a vom tu in na vawt thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A hite ‘Hi’ ma ci vun, ahi ngawlte ‘Hi ngawl’ ma ci vun — tua tungsia pauna sia Ngilopa kung pan hong pai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“ ‘Mittang khat luang mittang khat, hatang khat luang hatang khat, ci thu na zaaksa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahihang kei kong cina pan: no tungah hong khialte na thuk kik heak vun; khat po in na biangkho ziatsang hong beang le na biangkho veisang zongh na ngat vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaciang khat po in na laktong khat dei in zum ah thu hong vawt le na laktong puasilh zongh na pia thua lai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua mun a ngak ngalkapte in, tai khat vanh pua in hong sawl le, tai nii puaksak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Khat po in na khat hong ngen le pia vun; khat po in na khat hong zawng nuam le zawn vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“ ‘Na lawmte it vun a, na ngalte ensan vun,” ci thu na zaaksa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ahihang kei kong cina pan: na ngalte it vun a, hong vawtsiate atu thungetsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Vantung a na Pa ii tate na sua thei natu in, tuabangin ngamta vun. Banghang ziam cile ama in mihing phate tung le mihing siate tungah a kibangin ni taangsak a, na pha seamte le a sia seamte tung zongh ah a kibangin nguazusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“No hong itte bek na it uh le, Pathian in banghangin thaman hong pia tu ziam? Shiadongte ngawngawn zongh, tuabangin ngamta kana ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuaciangin na lawmte bek na paupui uh le, ngualdang taw bang na kilamdanna uh om ziam? Doai biate zongh in tuabangin ngamta kana ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Vantung a na Pa uh cialcing ahi bangma in, no zongh na cialcing uh kul hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Biakpiak vaipuakte na sep uh ciangin, mihon ii hong mu tu in, ngual sungah vawt heak vun. Tuabangin ngual sungah na vawt uh le, vantung a na Pa kung pan, thaman khat zongh na nga buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing cimaw khat huna na nei uh ciangin, mihing a kihitheamsakte in lampi liante tung le biakna innte ah a vawt uh bangin, pokngaina taw vawt heak vun. Amate ahile, mihingte pok tu thangai in tuabangin ngamta hi. A tatakin ka ci ciang, amate ii a thaman uh a cing takin kipia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang a cimaw khat na hu uh ciangin, na lawm phabel khat zongh in hesak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin kuama in hong heakpui ngawl tu hi. Tuaciang a kilangh ngawl a, na nasep hong mu, na Pa in thaman hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Thu na nget uh ciangin a kihisak mihingte bangin ngen heak vun! Amate lamkaa khawng le biakna innte ah ngual mu tu in ding a thungen thanuam uh hi. A tatakin ka ci ciang, amate a thaman uh a cing takin kipia zo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang no thu na nget uh ciangin, inndoi sungah tumin, inn na kha zawk uh ciang, a kimu thei ngawl, na Pa tungah thungen tavun. Tua hile noma ii heak bek a na ngamtatna uh hong mu na Pa in thaman hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Thu na nget uh ciangin, doai biate bangin, khiakna nei ngawl kammal tam mamate zangh heak vun, amate in thunget sau thethei a zak uh ciangin, a pathiante in za tuan tu in um uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate bang hi heak vun. Na nget uh ma in na Pa uh in, na kitaangsap uh teng hong he siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahiciang hi bangin thu ngen vun: Vantung a om kote Pa awng: Na min thiangtho ki upat tahen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na Kumpingam hong piang tahen; Vantung ah na deina a kicin bangin Leitung ah kicing tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu ni in ka khamkhop tu an hong pia ta in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ko tungah hong khialte ka maisak uh bangma, Kote khialna zongh hong maisak ta in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ze etna haksa hong thuaksak heak in a, Ngilopa ii khutsung pan hong tan ta in. Uk zawkna, vaangletna le minthanna Nang aa hi tawntung tahen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ngual ii note tung a hong khialnate na maisak uh le, vantung a na Pa zongh in, note khialna zongh hong maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang ngual khialna na maisak bua uh le na Pa zongh in note khialna hong maisak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuaciang, an na tan uh ciang, a kihisak theamte bangin maikhingin om heak vun. Amate sia a antan hunlam uh ngual heak tu in kipua ngawl lui in om hi. A tatakin ka ci ciang, amate in a thaman uh a cing takin a kipiasa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An na tan uh ciang, na mai uh phiatin na sam uh pot vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tua hi le na antan uh hunlam ngualdang in hong he tuan ngawlin, a kimu ngawl na Pa bek in hong he tu hi. Tuaciang, nangma bek heak a na ngamtat sia na Pa in, hong mu tu a, thaman hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na nei na lamh uhte, nget ii neak tu, a eakseau tu le ngutate in phuul a, a nguk theina, leitung ah noma atu in khol heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hi zaw ngawlin, na nei na lamh uhte, nget neak thei ngawl, eakseau thei ngawl ngutate in phuul a, a nguk thei ngawlna, vantung ah na khol vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile na neisate omna munah na thin na lung uh om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mittangte sia pumpi atu in meivak ahi hi. Na mittangte a ciidam le na pumpi khuavak taw kidim tu hi. Ahihang na mittangte a pha buale na pumpi khuazing sungah om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom na sungah a om khuavak sia khuazing hi thong le bangza in zingcip tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Kuama in to nii ii sal hi thei ngawl hi. Ama in khat ensan tu a, khat it tu hi; khat ii tungah thumaan tu a khat puavawk tu hi. Pathian le sum ii sal na seam khawm thei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Na nuntak thei natu in, an le tuite ahizong, na pumpi atu in puante ahizong, tuate huvau thintoi heak vun, kong ci sia hisia hang ahi hi. Nuntakna sia an sangin manpha zaw kana ngawl ziam? Pumpi sia puan sangin manpha zaw kana ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A leang kawkoai vacimte en vun: amate in thai tu ngawl, anla ngawl a, saal sungah an khol ngawl hi; ahihang vantung ah na Pa in, amate vaak hi! Note sia vacimte sangin manpha mama zaw ngawl kana nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Note sung pan thinngimna taw na khan uh bekno khat beak sauzawsak thei natu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tuaciang puansilh tu banghangin thintoi nu ziam? Duisung paakte en tavun, bangbangin khang ziam: amate in na le seam ngawl a, puansilh nikteen le vawt ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahihang a maan tatakin kong ci ciangin, Solomon Kumpipa in, a hau mama hang, hi paakte za in a hoi puan nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuni in po a, zing ciang a bo tu meikhuk sung a kihal tu lopa — hi lopa a zeam sia Pathian hi. Ama in no hong zeam zaw tu ahi sia muang ngawl nu ziam? Na nei uh upna sia bangza in no ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, ‘bang ka ne tu a, bang ka dawn tu? bang puan ka silh tu ziam?’ ci in thinngim heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />(Hite sia doai biate ii thinbot thei bul thute ahi hi.) Vantung a om na Pa in, hite theampo na kitaangsap uh hong he nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua sangin Pathian Ukna-ngam le ama in nang tung pan bang dei ziam, ci sia thupisak masa vun, tua hile ama in tua nadang theampo zongh hong sik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ahikom zing ciang atu in, thinngim heak vun; zing ciang in ama khom tu ma thinngimna nei tu hi. Ni sim hong piang thinngimnate belap kul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Pathian ii note tungah thu hong khen ngawl natu in, ngual tungah thu na khen heak vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ngual tungah thu na khen uh babangin note tungah Pathian in thu hong khen tu hi. Ngual tungah na zak uh na ngeina let uh teng ma no tungah hong kizangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahile banghangin na suapuipa mittang sungah ninteak sia mu thei in, noma mittang sungah thingluang sia thupi laak ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noma mittang sunga, thingluang khat om nginge sia, awlmawk ngawlin na suapuipa munah, ‘Na mittang sungah ninteak sia laaksak tong,’ banghangin ci ngam nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />No a kihisak minamte awng! Noma mittang sungah thingluang sia la keak phot vun, tua hile na suapuipa mittang sung ninteak sia na laak thei natu in, thiang takin na mu thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“A thiangtho nate uite na pia heak vun — amate in noma hong pet kik zaw tu hi. Vokte mai ah na suang manphate na lot heak vun — amate in a peang nuai a siikcil lel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ngen vun na nga tu uh hi; zong vun na mu tu uh hi; king vun, kongkha hong kihon tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a ngen pawpo in nga a, a zong khat pawpo in mu a, a king sia kongkha kihon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pa ahi note khat pawpo, na tate in anluum hong nget uh ciang, suangtum na pia tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahibuale ngasa hong nget ciang, ngul na pia tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na phat ngawl uh kawm panin na tate atu napha piak tu na he uh hi. Tua ahile, vantung ah na Pa in a ngente tungah naphate bangza in hong pia zaw kan tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Noma tungah hong kivawt le na oai uh bangin, ngual tungah na vawt vun; tuasia in Moses Thukham le kamsaangte hilnate ii a khiakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kongbiang ciak sungah na tum vun, banghang ziam cile hell ngam kongbiang sia zai a, tua mun paina lampi sia tot ol hi, tua lampi a tawn mihing tam mama om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang nuntakna sung tum natu kongbiang sia ciak a, tua mun pai natu lampi sia tot hak hi, tuaciang tua lampi a mu mihing tawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Leilot kamsaangte na up ngawl natu kidawm vun; amate a puatham ah tuu bangin hong pai tu a, a sungsang uh sia ngia hangsan bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ngamtatna uh panin amate na tel tu uh hi. Lingsawl te in, sapitnga ngeingawl a, lingkungte in theipum nga ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thingkung ciidamte in a nga pha nga a, ahihang thingkung ngina ngawlte sia a nga pha nga ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thingkung ciidamte in, a nga pha ngawl nga thei ngawl a, thingkung ngina ngawlte in a nga pha nga thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thingkung khat pawpo a nga a pha buale kiphuk in mei sungah kisep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahiciang leilot kamsaangte amate nasepna tung pan na tel thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ ‘Topa, Topa’ hong ci theampo Vantung ngam sungah a tum siat buatu hi, vantung ah ka Pa deina bang a ngamtate bek tum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thukhenna Ni hong thet ciang, mihing tam mama te in, ‘Topa, Topa! Na min taw Pathian thuhil in, na min taw doaite tam mama notkeak in, nalamdang tam mama vawt hi ngawl khu ziam?’ ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, ‘Note hong he ngei bong, Ka kung pan taikeak vun, no misiate awng!’ ka ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, kei kammal hite za a, a zaak uh bang a zuite sia suangpi tungah inn sa mihing ciimpa taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nguazu in khuanawl hong sua ciang, tua inn vuipi in nawmngawp hi. Ahihang tua inn suangpi tungah kisa ahikom a puk bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ahihang kei kammal hite za napi in, a zui ngawlte sia sen tungah inn sa mihing mawmaw pa taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nguazu in, khuanawl suak a, vui in a nawmngawp ciang, tua inn cimhtham hi. Tua in a lauhuai puna ahi hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesus in hi thusonteena a nei zawkciang, mi honpi in ama hilzia lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama Thukham hil syate taw a kibang bua hi; ama in thuneina taw hil hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus mualtung pan hong tuaksuk ciang mihonpite in zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin a lauhuai vun natna vei khat hong pai a, Jesus mai ah khupdin in “Topa hong damsak nuam po lete hong damsak thei tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesus in a khut zan a, ama thamin, “Hong damsak nuam khi hi, dam ta'n,” ci hi. Thakhat thu in, pasalpa a natna pan dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in, “Ngai in, kuama munah son heak in a, thiampipa kungah pai vingveng in, na pumpi vealsak ta'n; na damna thu ngual theampo hong heak natu in, Moses thupiak bangin sangaw biakpiakna vawt ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesus Capernaum khua sungah a tum laitakin, Rome ngalkapmang khat taw kisi a, tua pa in Jesus munah hu ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Topa awng, ka naseampa sia inn ah ciina in lum a, tungh thei ngawlin ngim mama hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Na inn ah hong pai in, damsak tu khi hi,” Jesus in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang ngalkap hon ukpa in, “Topa awng, ka inn sungah nang nong pai tu sia ka kiphu bua hi. A dam natu thu hong piaksak po lete ka naseampa dam tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Keima mama zongh uliante khutnuai ah om a, keima khutnuai a ngalkapte om hi. Khat tungah, ‘Pai in’ ci leng pai a, ‘hong pai tan’ ci leng hong pai hi. Ka salpa munah hi sia seam in ci leng seam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesus in hi thu a zaak ciangin, lamdang sa in, a nungzuite munah, “A tatakin ka ci ciang Israel ngam sungah hi bang upna mu ngeingawl khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“A maan tatak ka ci ciang, nisuana le nitumna panin, mihing tam mama hong pai tu a, Vantung ngam sungah Abraham, Isaac le Jacob taw anneakpoai sungah hong tokhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang tua Kumpingam sungah om tu a kilawmte, khuazing sungah kivawk tu a, tua munah kapin ha ngoai in om tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, Jesus in ngalkap hon ukpa munah, “Va cia ta'n, na upna bangin hong kivawtsak tu hi,” ci hi. Tuaciang ngalkap hon ukpa naseampa tua hun laitak ma in dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus in Peter inn ah pai a, tua munah Peter sunghnu a ci suukin lupna tungah om mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesus in Peter sunghnu khut thamsak hi; a cisa natna dam a, tho in Jesus zindo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nitak ciang mihingte in Jesus kungah doaivei tam mama hong paipui uh hi. Jesus in thaa ngilote kammal khat taw notkeak a, tuaciang ciina theampo damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ama mama in ih natna satnate hong puaksak a, ih ciluang natna hong laakkeaksak hi,” ci in Isaiah kamsaangpa ci teng a taangtun natu in seam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesus in a kiim a mihonpite a mu ciang, a nungzuite munah tuili ngalkhat ah a pai natu in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thukhamhil sya khat in, “Sya awng, na paina po ah paikhawm tu in, ka kinging hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesus in, “Ngiate in kua nei a, vacimte in bu nei uh hi. Ahihang Mihing Tapa in lup natu le, tawlngak natu a nei bua hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nungzui ngei dang khat in, “Topa awng, hong ciasak ta'n a, ka pa na vui phot tong,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesus in, “Hong zui ta'n, mithite in amate ii mithi vui tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesus ngunkuang tung to a, a nungzuite zongh in ama zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thakhat thu in a kiitakhuai vuipi suangval khat tuili tungah hong va a, ngunkuang sia tui ii a khup tu lauhuai hi. Ahihang Jesus mutthip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nungzuite a kungah pai in, phong uh hi. “Hong hun ta'n, Topa, thi dektak khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesus in, “Banghangin tuaza liangin lau nu ziam? Na upna uh bangza in no ziam?” ci hi. Tua zawkciang ama dingto a, vuipi le tuihualte a thim natu in thupia a, tuasia ciangin thim dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihing simin lamdang sa uh hi “Hisia pa bangbang mihing hi thong ziam? Vui le tuihualte ngawngawn in a thu ni hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuili ngalkhat Gadara ngam ah Jesus a thet ciangin, thaan hawng sung pan hong pusuak pasal nii taw kisi uh hi. Hi mihingte doaivei a, kiitakhuai mama ahikom tua lampi tawnin, kuama khualhaw ngam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thakhatin amate cik-au uh a, “Nang Pathian Tapa awng, ko bang hong law nuam ni ziam? A hun hong thet ma in, daan pia tu in hong pai ni ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuak nai ah vok honkhat taa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahikom doaite in Jesus munah, “Nong notkeak tu ahile zia lai a vok honte sungah hong tumsak ta'n,” ci in ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesus in, “Pai tavun,” ci hi. Tuasia ciang amate in a omna uh nusia in paisan a, vokte sungah tum uh hi. Vok hon bup liangpangh ah kinuntaw sukin, tuili sungah tuitaa in thi siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vok cingte tai in khua sungah tum a, tua munah doaiveite tung a thupiang theampo son siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ahikom khuapi sung pan mihingte Jesus taw kisi tu in hong pai tek uh hi; ama a mu uh ciangin a ngam uh panin a pusua natu ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in ngunkuang tungah to kik in tuili langkhat ama khuapi ah cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah mihing pawlkhat in pumzaw pasal khat lupna tungah a lum sa in, Jesus kungah hong paipui uh hi. Jesus in amate upna bangza lian ziam ci in a mu ciang, pumzaw pa munah, “Na thin kiliansak in, ka tapa awng. Na mawna hong kimaisak zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Thukham hil syate pawlkhat in, “Hisia pa in Pathian zawnsakna kampau hi,” ci in phun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesus in amate thinsung a ngaisut uhte he ahikom, “Banghangin tuabang thinsiatnate ngaisutin nei nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Na mawna hong kimaisak zo hi,’ ci le ‘tho in a lampai in,’ ci koisia ol zaw ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing Tapa in leitung ah mawmaisak theina thu nei hi, ci in kong lak tu hi,” ci hi. Pumzaw pa munah, “Tho in, Na luppha luakin, na inn ah cia ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasal pa tho in a inn ah cia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihonte in a mu uh ciangin liinglawng uh a, mihingte tungah tuabang thu nei theina a piak hu in, Pathian pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesus in tua mun nusia in lamdung zui in a pai laitak Matthew a kici shiadong khat a zum sungah a to mu hi. Tua pa munah, “Hong zui ta'n,” ci hi. Matthew zongh dingin zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesus Matthew inn ah an ne in a om laitak, shiadong tam mamate le a dang a kipuavawk te hong pai a, Jesus le a nungzuite taw an nekhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi bangin a om uh, Pharisee te pawlkhat in mu a, “Banghangin na Syapa uh hi bang mihingte taw an nekhawm ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesus in za a, “Mihing a ciidamte in syavuan kisamh ngawl a, ciinate bek in kisamh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Sangaw biakpiakna ka dei bua a, cikna thuthiamna bek ka dei hi,’ ci laithiangtho ii khiakna sia kan phot tavun. Mihingphate sam tu in kong pai bua a, mawneite sam tu in kong pai hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, Tuiphumpa John nungzuite hong pai a, Jesus tungah, “Ko le Pharisee te in an tang nithi a, banghangin na nungzuite in an tang ngawlhet ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesus in, “Mopoai sungah zi neipa a om lai teng a leangnate khuangai thei tu in na um uh ziam? Ni khat ni ciang zi neipa amate sung pan kila tu a, tuasia ciang amate an tang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kuama in laktong puasilh luisa khat puanbek thak taw phaw ngeingawl hi. Tuabangin phaw le puan thak sia hong ton tu a puan lui sia, ekkeak seseam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuabang ma in savun thawl lui sungah sapittui a thak kithaal ngeingawl hi, banghang ziam cile sapittui in savun thawl hong saantham tu hi. Sapittui buakeak in a thawl lalcip tu hi. Tua hi ngawl zaw in, sapittui a thak sia savun thawl thak sungah kithaal le a nii ma in lal ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesus in hi bang a pau laitakin, Jew ulian khat hong pai a, a mai ah khupdin in, “Ka tanu a thi zawk hiat bek ahi hi. Ahitazong hong pai lete a, ama tungah na khut nga lete, ama nungta kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Jesus dingin ama zui a, nungzuite in tonpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kum sawm le kum nii tawntung chibua natna a vei numei khat Jesus nung pan hong pai a, a puanmong tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A puan bek ahizong tham leng dam tu khi hi,” ama le ama kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesus hong kingeilee kik a, numei sia a mu ciangin, “Na thin kiliansak in, ka tanu awng! Na upna in hong damsak zo hi,” ci hi. Tua hun lianin, numeinu dam thiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus ulianpa inn sungah tum hi. Mithi vui tu music thiamte le a ngamlum lialua mihonte a mu ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na vekpi pusuak vun. Numeino sia thi ngawl hi, a mu hi bek hi,” ci hi. Tuasia ciangin amate in Jesus nuisan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang mihonte a kipusuasak siat zawkciang, numeino ii inndoi tuam sungah Jesus tumin a khut a let ciangin, numeino thoto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi thu huvau tua ngamkhen sung bup ah thang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesus in tua mun nusia in a pai ciang, mittaw niite in ama zui tu in kipan uh hi. “David Tapa awng, ko hong hesuak ta'n,” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesus inn sungah a sungtan zawkciang, mittaw nii ama kungah hong pai a, Jesus in, “No hong damsak thei tu in nong um uh ziam,” ci in dongh hi. “Topa, hong um ung,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Jesus in, a mitte thamsak a, “Na up uh bangin piang tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin amate in khuamu thei uh hi. Jesus in, “Hi thu kuama tungah son heak vun,” ci in nasia takin khaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahihang amate pai in, Jesus thu, tua ngamkhen bup sungah kizel in thangsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mittawte a pai zawkciang mihing pawlkhat in, doaivei in a pau thei ngawl pasal khat Jesus kungah hong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahihang a doai a kinawkeak zawk po ciangin ama hong pau paih a, a om theampo in lamdang sa uh hi. “Hi bang peuma Israel ngam sungah mu ngei bua hing!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahihang Pharisee te in, “Jesus tungah doaite nawkeak thei natu vaang a pia sia in doaimangpa ahi hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesus in khuapi khuanote ah vakkotin haw kawkoai hi. Synagogue te ah hilna nei in Kumpingam Lungdamna Thu, thuhil in nei a, natna satna namcin le ciluang natna damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mihonte a et ciangin, hesuakhuai sa hi, banghang ziam cile tuucing om ngawl tuuhonte bangin, amate thinngim cimaw in, om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ahikom nungzuite munah, “Anlaak tu tam mama a, ahihang lo sungah anla tu, mi tawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ahikom anneipa tungah, anla tu mi tam mama hong sawl natu, thu na ngen vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in nungzui sawm le niite khawmin, doai ngilo naw theina le, natna satna le ciluang natna theampo damsak thei natu thu neina pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nungzui sawm le nii teng sia hi teng ahi hi; a masa phit in Simon (Peter zongh kici) le a suapuipa Andrew, Zebedee ii tate James le a suapuipa John;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philip le Bartholomew; Thomas le shiadongpa Matthew; Alphaeus ii tapa James le Thaddaeus;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minam it pa Simon, le Judas Iscariot kici Jesus leeheakpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi sawm le nii teng hi bangin thupiakna taw Jesus in sawl hi: “Gentile mite ngamsung mun khat pawpo le Samaria te khuapi pawpo ah, pai heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuu bangin a mangthang Israel mite kungah paizaw vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pai tavun a, ‘Vantung ngam hong nai zo hi!’ ci in thuhil tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ciinate na damsak vun a, mithite na nungtasak kik vun, a lauhuai vun natna veite damsak vun a, doaite not vun. A thongin na saan uh bangma, man la ngawlin pia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na zaip sungah khamh, ngunn le taausan sumte pua heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nguai an keng heak vun a, puan laih natu le peangdap laih natu keng thua heak vun, ciangkhut zongh keng heak vun. Naseam khat sia a kitaangsap tu teng, kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Khuapi khat ahizong, khuano khat ahizong, na thet uh ciang, a sungah tum vun a, no zin hong do nuam khat po zong phot vun, tua mun pan na din kik uh dong, zin kheal heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Inn khat sungah na tum uh ciangin, ‘Thupha na nga tavun,’ ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua innteakte in, hong saang a, ahile, thupha nga tavun ci a, na paupui nate, tua munah kip tahen, ahizong, hong saang nuam bua ahile tua na piak thuphate dawk kik tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang innkuan khat po khua khat po in hong saang nuam bua a, na thuson hong ngai nuam buale, tua mun taisan tavun a, na peang nuai leivuite thin vaset tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tatak kong ci ciang thukhen ni ciangin tua khua mite sangin, Sodom le Gomorrah khua mite tungah Pathian in hesuakna lak zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ngai vun! Note tuu bangin ngiahon sungah kong tha hi. Ngul bangin pilvang vun a, ngam vakhu bangin cingh tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kidawm tavun, banghang ziam cile mihingte in hong man tu a, zum ah hong then in, synagogue te ah hong vel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei hu in note sia ngamukte le kumpite mai ah hong kipuak tu a thu hong sit tu hi. Amate tung le Gentile te tungah Lungdamna Thupha huvau na son thei natu hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in note thu kisit tu in hong aap ciangin, na pau tu uh le na pauzia tu uhte tungtaang ah thinngim heak vun; a hun hong thet ciangin na pau tu uhte hong kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile kammal na pau uhte sia no kammal hi ngawl tu hi; tuate sia na pa ii Thaa tung pan hong pai a, note tungtawnin hong pau ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mihingte in a suapuite thalup tu in aap tu a, pate zongh in tate tungah tuabang ma in ngamta tu hi; tate zongh in nute pate langpan tu a, thatlumsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei hangin a kuama theampo in, hong ensan tu hi. Ahihang a tawp dong a thuak zo sia kihun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khuapi khat sungah hong kivawtsiat ciangin, khuapi dang khat ah tai vun. A tatakin kong ci ciang, Mihing Tapa hong pai kik ma in, Israel te khuapi theampo ah na nasep, na khuangkhim zo buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nungzui khat sia a syapa sangin lianzaw ngawl hi; sal khat sia a topa sangin lianzaw ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom, nungzui khat sia a syapa taw a kiban ciangin, lungkim tahen a, sal khat zongh in a topa taw a kiban ciangin, lungkim tahen. Baangkua pabel sia Beelzebul a kici le, a innkuan pui dangte zongh min a sia seseam taw kina tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, mihingte kiita heak vun. Tu laitakin a kiseal theampo kilangh tu a, thuku theampo kipualaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khuazing sungah kong son theampo khuavak sungah na son kik tu uh hi. Tuaciang a thimtham a na zaak theampo, innkhum tung panin, na thangsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pumpi that thei a, a thaa a that thei ngawlte na kiita heak vun; hell sungah thaa le pumpi a lalcip khawmsak thei Pathian kiita zaw vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile dangkasan pheak khat taw tonbawm nii kilei thei hi, ahitazong na Pa ii thukimna ngawl taw tonbawm khat zongh leitung ah taak thong ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Note na hi uh le na lu tungah na samzamte dongin hong kisimsak siat sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahikom lau heak vun; note sia tonbawm tam mamate sangin manpha zaw nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Mihingte mai ah khat po in kei neisa a hina a pualaak le, vantung ka Pa mai ah, kei zongh in tuabang ma in ka pualaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahihang mihingte mai ah khat po in kei hong nial a ahile, vantung ka Pa mai ah kei zongh in ka nial tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Leitung ah kilemna puak tu in hong pai hi, ci in ngaisun heak vun; kilemna puak tu in hong pai hi ngawl khi hi, namsau khat puak tu in hong pai khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tapate in a pate langpan tu a, tanute in a nute langpan tu a, mote in a tonupite langpansak tu in hong pai ka hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />mihing khat ii a thuak laakbel a ngal sia, ama innkuanpuite ma hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Kei sangin a nu a pa a itzaw sia kei nungzui tu in kiphu ngawl hi; kei sangin a tapa ahibuale a tanu a it zaw te kei nungzui tu in kiphu ngawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a kuama po, a thinglamtee kisuanhin ka nung hong zui ngawlte, kei nungzui tu in kiphu ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A nuntakna a nga natu a hanciam khat pawpo sia a nuntakna taan tu hi; ahihang a kuama po kei hangin a nuntakna a taan le, nuntakna tatak nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“A kuama po no hong saangte sia, kei hong saang ahi hi; tuaciang kei hong saangte sia kei hong sawlpa saang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A kuama po in mihing khat sia Pathian thupha puak a hina taw a saang le Pathian thupha puakte ii thaman kihawm tu hi. A kuama po in mihing khat sia mihing pha a hina taw a saang le mihing phate ii thaman ma kihawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hi sung ka nungzuite sung pan, a nobel khat sia, keima nungzui ahi hu in, tuidam hai khat bek a pia zong a maan takin thaman saang tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzui sawm le niite tungah hi hilnate a nei zawkciang, tua mun nusia in tua mun taw a kinai khuapite ah hilna le thuhilnate nei tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuiphumpa John in a thongtaakna mun panin, Christ nasepnate a zaak ciangin, a nungzuite pawlkhat kamtai in ama kungah paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in Jesus tungah, “Hong son ta'n, John ii ‘Hong pai lai tu hi,’ a ci sia nangma ni ziam maw, ngualdang khat muangmaw lai tu khu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesus in, “Heak kik tavun a, John munah na mu na zaak uh teng son kik tavun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mittawte khuamu in, peangbaite lampai thei a, a lauhuai vun natnate kidamsak in, nangongte khuaza thei a, a thisate kinungtasak kik in, a zawngte tungah Lungdamna Thupha kihil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei tungtaang ah a lungmang ngawlte bangza in lungdam ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />John nungzuite a cia kik laitakin, Jesus in John ii thu teng mihonte tungah son hi: “Sennealngam sungah om John kungah na pai uh ciang, bang teng mu tu in kimuangmaw nu ziam? Vui ii a kuaikhum lopate khat po ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A bangbel mu nuamin kuan nu ziam? Puansilh hoi nawno a silh pasal khat mu nuam na hi uh ziam? Mihing tuabang a, a kizeamte kumpite teenna innpite huang sungah teang bek hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hong son tavun; bang mu tu in pai nu ziam? Kamsaang khat ahi ziam? Hi tatak hi, na mu uh sia kamsaang thawthong bek hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile John sia laithiangtho ii: ‘Pathian in, ka kamtaipa na mai ah na lampi hong honsak khol tu in ka paisak tu hi,’ a ci sia pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tatak ka ci ciangin tuiphumpa John sia a piang ngei mihing khat pawpo sangin lianzaw hi. Ahihang Vantung ngam sungah a om a nobel khat sia John sangin lianzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />John ii thuhil a kipat pan tuni dong tatak ma Vantung ngam in nasia takin zawthawk thu taw sutolna thuak hi, a ngoltol mihingte in laak tu in hanciam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />John khang dong ma in, kamsaang theampo le Moses thukhamte in, Kumpingam thu huvau son uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciang amate thuhilte na um nuam uh le John sia Elijah hi a, hong pai tu a kisonkhol sa sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahiciang bil na nei uh le ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tu in, tu hun a mihingte bang taw teengat tu khi ziam? Amate sum zuakna phual a to, patangte taw kibang hi. Pawl khat in pawldang khat te oksan a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Mo kiteenna music kong tum uh a, laam nuam ngawl nu hi! Mithi vuina la kong sak uh a, kap nuam ngawl nu hi!’ kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />John in an tang a sapittui ne ngawlin hong pai ciang, ‘Ama ii sungah doai om hi,’ mihing theampo in ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing Tapa hong pai a, ama in ne in dawnin a om leleau ciang, ‘Hisia pa en vun! Antuangpa, zutuangpa, shiadongte le pawlsung pan a kipuavawkte ii lawmpa!,’ mihing theampo in ci uh hi. Ahitazong Pathian ii ciimna sia maan tatak hi ci in a piang thute panin kilak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesus ii nalamdang lakna a tamzaw a vawtna khuapite sungah a teang mihingte in, a mawna uh panin, kisiik kik tuan ngawl ahikom, ama in tua khuapite teih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nang atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam, Chorazin awng! Nang atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam, Bethsaida awng! Tyre le Sidon khuate tungah note sungah hong kivawt nalamdang laknate kivawt thong le, a mihingte in khau-ip puan silh in, amate tungah vut kithe in, mawna kisiik kikna a lak zawk ngei zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tatakin ka ciciang, Pathian thukhenna Ni hong thet ciang, note tung sangin Tyre le Sidon khua mite tungah Pathian in hesuakna tam lak zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciangin, Capernaum, nang na hile, nangma le nangma vantung dongin kilapto sawm na hi ziam? Hell khuk sungah na kisepsuk tu hi. Nang sungah a kiseam nalamdang laknate Sodom khua ah kiseam thong le tua khua sia tuni dongin kip lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tatakin kong ci ciang, Pathian thukhen ni hong thet ciangin, note sangin Sodom khua tungah Pathian in hesuakna tamzaw lak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Jesus in, “Simlei le vantung ii Topa, Pa awng hi thute mihing ciim mihing thiamte tung panin, na sealcip a, bangma he ngawl lai mihingte tungah lak na hikom na tungah ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi hi, Pa, hi bangin a pian tu sia na deina ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka Pa in na theampo kei hong pia zo hi. Pa simngawl kuama in Tapa a tel zo bua a, Tapa le Tapa ii a telsak nop a teal mihingte simngawl kuama in Pa a tel bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Vanhngit pua in, a toite theampo awng, kei kungah hong pai tavun, tawlngakna kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka hakkol la in kisuanh vun, kei tung pan hong kisin tavun, banghang ziam cile keima in cingh in a kiniamkhiak pa ka hi hi; tua ahikom toithaina na nga tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, hakkol kong sot tu sia puak nop a, vanh kong sot tu sia zaang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawk khuangeingawlin Jesus in Sabbath ni khat zungtaang lo sungah vak hi. A nungzuite a ngilkial ahikom zungtaang huite hiat in a humte ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pharisee te in hi bang a ngamtat uh a mu ciangin Jesus munah, “En in, Sabbath ni in na nungzuite hi bangin a ngamtat sia ih thukham taw kileebul hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesus in, “David le a mite a ngilkial uh laitak a ngamtatna thu a ki atte sim ngeingawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Pathian inn sungah a mite taw tum in, amate neak tu a kilawm ngawl thiampite bek neak tu kilawm anluum thiangtho a neakna thu sim ngeingawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahibuale thiampite in Sabbath sim ma in Biakinn sungah Sabbath thukham khial napi in, mawsakna a nga tuan ngawlna thu Moses thukham sungah sim ngeingawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tatakin kong ci ciang, hi sungah Biakinnpi sangin a lianzaw khat om nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, ‘Thuthiamna ka dei a, sangaw biaknate ka dei bua hi,’ a ci sia he tatak hi le uhte, a maw ngawl khat sia mawsak lalai ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Mihing Tapa sia Sabbath ii Topa ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesus in tua mun nusia in Synagogue inn khat ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua munah pasal khat sia khut langkhat zaw in om hi. Mihing pawlkhat in, Jesus ii ngamtat khialna encik in, a maw natu zong nuam ahikom hi bangin dongh uh hi, “Sabbath ni in ciina damsak tu sia ih thukham taw kileebul ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus in, “Note sungah mihing khat in tuu khat nei le a, tua tuu sia Sabbath ni in dum sungah taaksuk le ama in dum sungah zamh suk in pusua ngawl tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing sia tuu khat sangin manh neizaw pek hi! Tua ahiciang ih thukham in, Sabbath ni in mihing khat pawpo ih hu tu sia hong oai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a khutzawpa ii munah, “Na khut vaan in,” ci hi. Ama in a khut vaan a, a khut langkhat sang bangma in, a khut dam thiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Pharisee te pusuak in Jesus a thalup thei natu vaihawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesus in ama a kithasawmna thu a zaak ciangin, tua mun panin ama mundang zuan a, mihon tam mama in zui uh hi. Ama in ciina theampo damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciangin, kei thu kuama munah son heak vun, ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi bangin a vawtna sia kamsaangpa Isaiah ii a sonkhol sa teng a taangtut natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hi sungah ka tealsa ka naseampa om hi. Ka lung hong kimsak ka itpa ahi hi. ama tungah ka Thaa ka pia suk tu a, tuaciang ama in, ka thukhenna minam tuatuamte tungah thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in thu nial ngawl tu a, a au buatu hi. Lampi lian tungah au vazakin thu a son buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a kikuaikhum sa pumpa a thiaktan buatu a, a mit dek tak meiinn zongh a mit buatu hi. Ama in thutang khenna ii zawna a ngasak dong hanciam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang ama ii tungah minam theampo in lametna nei tu hi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang mihing pawlkhat in Jesus kungah doai a vei hu in mittaw a, a pau thei ngawl pasal khat hong paipui uh hi. Khuamu thei a, a pau thei natu in, Jesus in damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesus sep teng a mu uh ciang mipite in lamdang sa uh hi. Amate in, “David tapa hi takpi tu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pharisee te in hi thu a zaak uh ciang “Doaite a ukpa Beelzebul in ama ii vaangletna pia a tua hu in doaite notkeak thei hi thong zam,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesus in amate khua ngaisutnate tel ahikom amate tungah, “Ngam khat pawpo pawl tuatuamin kikhen hen a, kidawdo le tua ngam a kip ngei buatu hi. Khuapi khat ahizong innkuan khat ahizong, pawl tuatuamin kikhenin, kihau siasua le a kitamhtham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom Satan ngamsung zongh ah pawl tuam khat in, a dang pawltuam dangkhatte do in a om uh le Satan ngam a kikhen tham hi zo a, hai ngawlin zaantham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Beelzebul hong piak vaangletna taw doaite notkeak hi hong ci nu hi. Pha hi, tua ahile na nungzuite akua in doai nawkeak theina vaang pia ziam? Na nungzuite ngamtatna panin, na khial hunlam kitel hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi ngawl hi. Doai nawkeak natu vaangletna hong pia sia Beelzebul hi ngawl a Pathian Thaa ahi hi. Tua ahikom hi thu mama in, Pathian Ngam sia note tungah hong theng zo hi,” ci in kitelsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Kuama in mihing thahatpa inn sungah tumin, a neisa ol takin a laaksak thei bua hi, tua mihing a thahatpa sia a letheen cip phot kul hi. A letheen zawkciang bekma in, a inn kiphuul thei pheang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Khat pawpo kei sang a hong pang ngawl sia in kei hong langpan pa ahi hi; khat pawpo hong kaikhawm pui ngawl sia in, a thezau tatak pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi thu hangin kong ci in ah, mihingte mawna le kamsia paunate kimaisak thei hi; ahizong Thaa Thiangtho sonsiate kimaisak zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihing Tapa a sonsiate kimaisak thei hi; ahihang Thaa Thiangtho a sonsiate tu hun ahizong, maisang a tawntung ahizong kimaisak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Thingnga pha a pian natu in, thingkung ciidam kul hi; thingkung ciidam ngawlte panin thingnga mannung ngawlte piang hi. Thingkungte a nga panin kihe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />No ngul ngilo suante awng — mihing ngilote na hi uh ciang, bangbangin thupha son thei tu nu ziam? Banghang ziam cile thinsung pan a, a dimleet teng sia kam panin kipau ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mihing phate in a thinsung a ngaisutna pha a kholsa te sung panin pau uh a; mihing ngilote in a thinsung thusia a kholte panin kamsia pau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“A tatakin kong ci ciang, Thukhenna Ni ciangin, mihing sim in, phattuamna hong pia ngawl kammal khat a paute tungtawnin, thusitna thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Noma kammalte mama in, na maw uh le na tan uh thu hong khen tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Thukham hil syate le Pharisee te pawlkhat in, “Syapa awng, nalamdang lakna na vawt ka mu nuam uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesus in, “Tu hun mihingte sia, bangzata in sia a, Pathian nei ngawl ziam! Nalamdang lakna hong ngen na hi uh ziam? Hong pia ngawl tu khi hi! No tung a hong kipia tu nalamdang lakna in kamsaangpa Jonah, nalamdang lakna sia bek hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonah in sun thum le zan thum ngasa lian ii ngil sungah a om bangin, Mihing Tapa zongh sun thum le zan thum leithukna sungah om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Thukhenna Ni ciangin Nineveh khua mite hong ding tu a, note hong mawsak tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Jonah thuhilna a zaak uh ciangin a mawna uh pan kisiik kik hi; a maan tak kong ci ciang in hi sungah Jonah sangin a lianzaw khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Thukhenna Ni ciangin, Sheba kumpinu zongh hong ding tu a, note hong mawsak tu hi, banghang ziam cile, ama in a khuala mama ngam pek pan in, Solomon kumpipa ciimna taw thuhilna ngai tu in khual hong haw hi; a maan tak kong ci ciangin, hi lai ah Solomon kumpipa sangin a lianzaw khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Mihing khat sung pan doai ngilo khat sia a pusua ciang a tawlngak natu zongin, munko ngawtaakna ngam ah vak kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A mu ngawl ciang, ‘Ka inn zuan kik ka heu tong,’ ama le ama kici a, a inn ah a cia kik le a inn awng a, kipua thiang sa in a om mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin ama pusuak in, ama sangin a siazaw lai doai a dang sali hong tumpui a, tua munah teang uh hi. A tawpna ah tua doai ii teenna mihing sia a kipat lai sangin lawmawk zaw hi. Tu lai mihing siate tungah hi bangma piang tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesus in mihonpite thu a hil laitakin, A nu le a suapuipate hong theng hi. Amate in paupui nuam in doipua ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua munah a om mihing khat in ama munah “En in! Na nu le na suapuipate in hong paupui nuamin doipua panin hong ngak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jesus in, “Ka nu akua ziam? Ka suapuite akua teng ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuaciang, a nungzuite kawkin, “En vun! hite sia ka nu le ka suapuipate ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Vantung ah ka Pa deina bang a ngamtate sia ka suapuipa, ka suapuinu le ka nu ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni ma in Jesus inn pan pusuak in, tuili hui ah to a, thuhilna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kiim ah hong kikhawm mihonpite tam mama ahikom, hilna nei tu in ama ngunkuang tungah to a, mipite vaalbo ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in thu tam mama a son natu in, thusonteenate zangh hi. “Khatvei lai in, pasal khat sia thaicii poai tu in kuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lo sungah thaiciite a poai ciangin, thaicii pawlkhat sia lamzin tungah taakin, vacimte pai a, ne siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thaicii pawlkhat suang tam, lei daina ah taak hi. Tawmvei sungin thaicii po hi, banghang ziam cile lei thuk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang ni a sat ciangin ankung note kaanghlum hi; zung thuk tha ngawl ahikom, ankungte ko ngawtaak cip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thaicii pawlkhat lingphung sungah taak a, tua lingte khangin ankungte deapcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang thaicii pawlkhat lei phana ah taakin, ankungte hui a; a kung pawlkhat ii tung pan a zaa zakhat, pawlkhat a zaa sawmluk, pawlkhat a zaa sawmthum in nga hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Bil nei po in za tavun!” ci in Jesus in a thuson khup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciangin nungzuite Jesus kungah pai a, “Mihingte tungah thu na son ciangin, banghangin thusonteena veu taw thuson ni ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus in, “Vantung ngam thuku sia note tungah hong kipia hi; ahihang amate tungah kipia ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile neisa khat po a nei kholte tungah kipia thua tu hi, tam seseam a nei natu in, kipia thua tu hi; ahihang bangma a nei ngawl khat tung panin a nei sun teng zongh, kilaaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate tungah thusonteena taw thu ka son sia, banghang ziam cile, amate in en ahihang mu ngawl a, ngai ahihang za ngawlin tel ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Isaiah sonkholna sia amate tungah kibul thei hi; ‘Hi mihingte in ngangai ahihang tel ngawl tu hi. Amate in e en ahihang mu ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile amate thin bulthu zo a, a bil uh kihu cip zo in, a mit uh si cip zo uh hi. Tua ahibuale a mittang uh taw mu tu a, a bil uh taw za tu a, a thinsung taw tel tu uh hi. Tuaciang kei kungah hong zuan tu uh hi. Tuasia ciangin amate ka damsak tu hi, Pathian in ci hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Note na hi uh le bangza in hampha nu ziam! Na mittangte khuamu uh a, na bilte in khuaza uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tatak ka ci ciang, kamsaang tam mama le Pathian mi thiangtho tam mamate in, no ii mu teng mu nuam mama a, no ii zaak teng za nuam ahihang amate in mu ngawlin za ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tua ahile ngai vun, thaicii poaipa thusonteena sia hi bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpingam thu huvau thu kisonte za napi a tel ngawlte sia lampi tungah a taak thaiciite taw kibang hi. Ngilopa hong pai a amate ii sungah a kituu thute laaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Suang tungah a taak thaiciite sia a thu a zaak uh po ciang, lungdam takin a saangte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang a thu in amate sungah a thuk in tum ngawl a, khuangei khom ngawl uh hi. Tua ahikom haksatna le vawtsiatna hong pai ciangin amate puk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lingphung sung a thaicii taakte sia a thu a zate ma hi a, ahihang nuntak natu thinngim in, hau tu a uukte hi a, tuate in khulup ahikom a nga a hui a nei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciangin lei phana ah a taak thaiciite ahile a thu za in a telte ahi uh hi: amate in a zaa zakhat, pawlkhat in a zaa sawmluk, pawlkhat in a za sawmthum in a nga uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesus in thusonteena dang khat son a: “Vantung ngam thu sia hi bang ahi hi. Pasal khat in a lo sungah thaicii pha poai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zan khat ciang, ngual theampo ii mut laanin, a ngalte khat hong pai a, taangkungte ii kawmah mimphei cii tuu in nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kungte po in a huite lua tu in a kipat ciangin, mimpheite kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lo neipa ii naseamte hong pai a, ‘Topa awng, lo sungah na poai thaiciite thaicii pha veu hi kana ngawl ziam?, koisung pan mimpheite hong piang ziam?’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Ngalte pawlkhat ii ngamtatna hi,’ ci in zo hi. ‘Mimpheite, kuan in botkeak le ung nong oai ziam?’ ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Oai ngawl khi hi; mimphei na baw uh ciangin taang zongh na botkeak tha tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anlaak hun dongin mimphei le taangte na po khawmsak lel vun. Tuasia ciangin anlate munah, mimphei teng bot phot vun a, lomsawm in hal vun, tuasia zawkciang taang teng la in ka saal sungah khum vun,’ ” ka ci tu hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesus in thusonteena dang khat ma son hi: “Vantung ngam thu sia hi bang hi. Pasal khat in ankamh cii la in lo sungah poai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama sia thaicii a minpiang a nobel ahi hi, ahihang hong let ciang, ankung lianbel suak hi. Ama sia thingkung suak ahikom vacimte in a baakte kawm ah bu hong vawt uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jesus in thusonteena dang khat ma son lai hi: “Vantung ngam thu hi bang hi. Numei khat in tol tawm la in anvui khum khat dim taw hel a, a vekpi in hong pawm hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesus in mipite tungah hi thute a son ciangin thusonteena zangh hi; thusonteena ngawl peuma taw thu khat zongh son ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hi bangin ahi sia kamsaangpa pauna a taangtut natu ahi hi, “Amate tungah ka pau ciangin thusonteena ka zangh tu hi; Simlei a kibitphua pan kipan a kihe ngeingawl thute amate tungah ka son tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesus in mipite nusia in innsung sangah a tum ciangin, a nungzuite ama kungah hong pai a, “Lo sungah mimphei thu thusonteena sia ii khiakna hong son ta'n,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Thaicii pha a tuu pasalpa sia Mihing Tapa ahi hi; lo sia hi leitung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thaicii pha sia Kumpingammite ahi hi; mimphei sia a ngilopa ii neisa mihingte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaciangin mimphei leisung a tuu ngalpa sia Doaimangpa ahi hi. Anlaak hun sia hun bona ahi hi, anlate sia vantunglalangte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mimpheite kitawm in meikuang sungah a kihal bangma in, hun bo ciang, tuabang ma a hi tu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mihing Tapa in, midangte a khialsakte le a sia vawt theampo khawm tu in, a vantunglalangte sawl tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />tuaciangin amate in tua mite meiphual sungah sep tu hi, tua munah amate kapin ha ngoai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuaciangin Pathian ii mihingte ahile Pa ii Ngam sungah ni bangin taang tu uh hi. Bil nei po in za tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Vantung ngam thu hi bang ahi hi. Pasal khat in lo khat sungah sum kiphual khat mu hi. Ama in lei huk kikin, lungdam mama ahikom a neisa theampo zuak a, tua zawkciang pai kikin, tua lo lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Vantung ngam thu in hi bang hi si hi. Pasal khat in suangmanpha zong a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />a hoi tangtuam mama khat a mu ciangin, a neisa theampo zuak in, tua suangmanpha lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Vantung ngam thu in hi bang hi si hi. Ngasa man pawlkhat in a ngeen uh tuili sungah paai in ngasa namcin man uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A ngeen uh a dim ciangin, vaalbo ah ngasate hawm tu in kaito a, ngasa phate pheal sungah kikoi in, ngasa manpha ngawlte kivawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hun bo ciangin hi bangin kingamta tu hi: vantunglalangte pai in mihing phate kawm panin mihing ngilote khawmtua in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />meiphual sungah amate vawk tu a, tua munah ha ngoai in kap tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jesus in, “Hi thute na tel uh ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Tel khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, Thukham hil syate khat pawpo sia Vantung ngam sungah nungzui a sua ciangin bang taw kibang ziam cile vanh kholna inndoi sung pan, vanh thak le vanh lui te a pusua inn neipa taw kibang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Jesus in hi thusonteena thute a son zawkciang tua mun nusia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />ama ii khua ah cia hi. Ama in Synagogue ah hilna nei a, a zate in lamdang sa uh hi. “Koisung panin ciimna hi bangte nga ziam? A nalamdang vawtte bangbangziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ama sia lettama pa tapa ma hi kana ngawl ziam? A nu sia Mary ma hi a, a suapuite sia James, Joseph, Simon le Judas te hi kana ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A suapuinumeite zongh hi lai ma ah teang hon kana ngawl ziam? Koisung panin hite theampo ka nga ci ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tua hi a amate in a saang thei bua uh hi. Jesus in amate munah, “Kamsaangpa khat sia ama khua le ama innkuan sung ngawl buang mundang theampo ah kizatak vawt hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Amate in upna nei ngawl ahikom, tua munah nalamdang lakna tam a vawt bua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Galilee ngamukpa Herod in Jesus thu za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A uliante munah, “Ama sia Tuiphumpa John hong nungta kik hi nanak tu hi, ci hi. Tua hu in, nalamdang lakna vawt theina vaang nei hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Herod in John a kimat natu thupia zo a, thong sungah khum hi. Hi bangin a vawt na sia Herod in a suapuipa Philip zi Herodias a teenpui hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuiphumpa John in Herod munah, “Herodias sia na teenpui tu hi ngawl hi,” ci ngei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Herod in ama thatlum nuam ahihang, Jew mite kiita hi, banghang ziam cile Jew mite in John sia kamsaang khat hi ci in ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Herod suani in a kikhawmte mai ah Herodias tanu laam hi. Herod lungkim mama a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Nong nget pawpo kong pia tu hi, ci in ka kiciam hi!” ci in kamciam pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nu sawl bangin, “Hi sungah tu ma in, kuangdal khat sungah John ii lutang hong pia ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa sia khuangai hi, ahihang leangnate mai ah, kamciam a piaksa ahikom a nget bangin, a kivawt natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom thong inn sungah John ii ngawng tansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lutang sia kuangdal tungah koi in, ngaknu nu kipia a, ama in a nu pia sawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />John nungzuite hong pai a, a luang pua in phum uh hi; tua zawkciang amate pai in Jesus munah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesus in John thute a zaak ciangin, ngunkuang khat sungah to in, a ngamkhingna mun khat ah ama nguakin pai hi. Mipite in tua thu za ahikom a khuapi uh nusia in leilam panin ama zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus in a ngunkuang tung pan tuak a, mihonpite a mu ciangin, tua mite hesuakhuai sa in ciinate damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nitakin a nungzuite in ama kungah hong pai uh a, “Tu in ni zongh niam mama zo hi. Hi mun sia ngamkhing mun ahi hi. Mihonpite paisak in a, khuano sungah amate le amate neak tu an leisak lete pha hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Amate paisak kul bo, amate neak tu an note in pia vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hi sungah ih nei theampo kingawm in anluum nga le ngasa nii hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tua ahile tuate keima kungah hong paipui tavun,” Jesus in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in mipite sia lopa tung a to siat natu in thupia hi; tua zawkciangin anluum nga le ngasa nii te la in, van ento a, Pathian munah lungdamko hi. Ama in anluumte baltham in nungzuite pia a, nungzuite in mipite pia sawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />mi sim in ne in kham tek uh hi. Tua zawkciangin nungzuite in, a kham vaal uh khum sawm le khum nii dim in seng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Numei le patang simngawl, pasal an ne sia tulnga bang pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mipite a inn tek ah cia in a sawl zawkciang, tuili ngal ah paikhol tu in, Jesus in a nungzuite ngunkuang sungah tosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mipite a ciasak siat zawkciang, ama nguakin mual tungah thungen tu in kaato hi. Nitak khuaniam hun dongin Jesus in tua munah ama nguakin om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tua hun laitakin ngunkuang sia tuili sungah khuala ma theng zo a, vui va ahikom ngunkuang sia tuihual in lok zazaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zingsang nai thum le nai luk kilaklaw in, Jesus in tui tung nungzuite sangah hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tui tungah a pai a mu ciangin, amate patau mama uh hi. “Thithaa hi tu hi!” ci in lau in ciik au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesus in amate tungah thakhatin, “Na thin uh kiliansak vun! Lau heak vun! Keima khi hi,” ci in paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Peter in, “Topa na hi takpi le nangma kung tui tungah kong pai thei natu in thu hong pia ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hong pai ta'n!” Jesus in ci hi. Tua ahikom Peter sia ngunkuang sung pan pusuak a, tui tung Jesus kungah lampai tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang vui va ngawp sia a mu ciangin lau in tui sungah taaksuk tu in kithoai hi. “Topa hong hun ta'n!” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thakhatin Jesus in ama zamh in, “Upna no pa awng, banghangin muang la ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate nii sia ngunkuang sungah hong thengin vui zongh thim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin ngunkuang sung a om nungzuite in Jesus bia uh hi. “Pathian Tapa takpi ma na hi hi!” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate sia tuili kaantan in Gennesaret vaalbo ah kaa uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua munah mihonte in Jesus ahi hunlam he uh hi. Tua ahikom kiimkot ngamte ah ciinate vaitha in, Jesus kungah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A puanmong beak ahizong ciinate a thamsak natu in, ama tungah ngen uh hi. Tuaciang a puanmong a tham theampo damsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jerusalem panin, Thukham hil syate pawlkhat Jesus kungah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Banghangin na nungzuite in ih taanghpupite hilnate ni ngawl ziam? A anneak ma in a ngeina bangin a khut sil ngawl hi!” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesus in, “Tua ahile Pathian thupiakte banghang ni ngawlin, noma phuatawm kihilnate zui nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in, ‘Na pa le na nu zakta vun’. Tuaciang ‘A pa ahibuale a nu a haamsiat pawpo sia thalupna thuak tahen,’ kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing khat in a pa ahibuale a nu a hu natu a, a kizangh thei na khat pawpo sia, ‘Hi sia Pathian atu a kipiasa hi’ ci pole,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a pa zatak vawt kul nawn ngawl hi, ci in thuhil nu hi. Hi bangin noma le noma na kihilna te na zui uh ciangin, Pathian thupiaknate paltan na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />No a kihitheamsakte awng! no huvau Isaiah ii sonkholnate bangza in maan ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Hi mite in a kammal uh taw kei zatakna hong pia hi; ahihang a thinsung sia kei taw kikhuala hi,’ Pathian in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei hong biakna sia amate atu in kimanna om ngawl hi. Banghang ziam cile amate in mihingte ii vawttawm ngeina sia, kei ii thukham bangin kihil uh hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in mihonpite samin hi bangin ci hi, “Ngai vun a, tel tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing khat a kam sungah a tum suk sia in ama zeksa ngeina bangin ninsak ngawl hi, a kam sung pan hong pusuak sia in ama ninsak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin a nungzuite, ama kungah pai in, “Tu a na pau teng a zaak ciangin, Pharisee te ii maktak hunlam na he ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Vantung a ka Pa ii suan ngawl peuma a kung simin kibotkeak tu hi,” ci in Jesus in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Amate tungtaang ah thinngim heak vun! Amate sia mittawte lampui mittawte ma ahi uh hi; mittaw khat in a dang mittaw khat lam a lak le, a nii in dum sungah taak suk tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Peter in, “Hi thu sonteena sia hong sonthiang ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesus in, “No sia ngualdangte sangin ciimzaw tuan ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tel ngawl nu ziam? Mihing khat a kam sung a tumsuk peuma sia a ngilpi uum sung thengsuk a, tuasung panin a pumpi puasia ah pusuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang kam sung pan a pusuakte sia thinsung pan hong pai hi a, hite in mihing khat sia zeksa taw kisai in ninsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a thinsung panin, ngitlo ngaisutnate hong pai a, ama sia mihing thalup natu, palngul natu, numei le pa khial natu; sutol natu, leilot natu le ngual min siatsak natu, in lamlak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hite in mihing khat sia ninsak hi. Ahihang amate ci bangin, khut sil ngawlin anneakna in, mihing khat sia ninsak ngawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesus in tua mun pan dingin, Tyre le Sidon khuapi taw a kinai ngam ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ngam ah a teang Canaan numei khat ama kungah hong pai hi. “David Tapa awng!” ci in au a, “Topa hong hesuak ta'n! Ka tanu doai vei in ngim mama hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in ama kam khat zongh a paupui bua hi. A nungzuite hong pai a, “Ama ciasak in! Ama in ei hong zui a, au tawntung hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in, “Kei sia tuu mangthang Israel mite mun bek ah hong kipaisak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang numeinu in a peang kungah bok a, “Topa awng hong hu ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesus in, “Tate ii anneak tu laaksak in uite ih piaksak tu sia kilawm ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua nu in, “Tua thu in thumaan hi. Topa awng, ahihang uite ngawngawn zongh, a tote sabuai tung pan a taak annengte ne kana ngawl ziam?,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua hi a Jesus in, “Nang sia upna lian a nei numei khat na hi hi! Na deina bang nang tungah hong tung tu hi,” ci hi. Tua hun lian laitakin a tanu dam thiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesus in tua mun nusia in Galilee tuili hui ah pai hi. Mualtung khat ah kaato in to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama kungah mihon hong paite in peangbai, mittaw, a koncip, a pau thei ngawl le ciina dang tam mama te, Jesus kungah paipui uh a; Jesus in amate damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pau thei ngawlte pau thei a, a koncipte dam in, peangbaite lampai thei a, mittawte in khua a mu thei uh ciang, tua munah mihingte in, lamdang sa in Israel te ii Pathian minthang pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzuite samin “Hi mihingte hu in ka thinnuam ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile, tu in ni thum pha zo a, bangma neak tu nei ngawl hi. Anvaak phot ngawlin cia thongsak nuam ngawl khi hi, banghang ziam cile, a inn uh a zot ciang lampi ah ngilkial in pukhong siat tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nungzuite in, “Hi sennealngam sungah mihing hiza neakkhom tu an, koisung pan nga thong tu khu ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Anluum bangza nei nu ziam?” ci in Jesus in dongh hi. “Anluum sali le ngasa no tawm nei ung,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus in mipite lei ah tosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Jesus in anluum sali le ngasate la in, Pathian tungah lungdam a ko zawkciang, balneen in a nungzuite pia hi; tuaciang in nungzuite in mipite pia sawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate theampo in ne uh a, kham tek uh hi. Nungzuite in a kham vaal uh khum sali dimin seng lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Numei patang sim ngawlin pasal an ne peuma mihing tulli pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua zawkciang mipite sia Jesus in ciasak a, ama zongh ngunkuang tungah to in Magadan ngam ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pharisee te pawlkhat le Sadducee te pawlkhat Jesus kungah hong paite in ama sia Pathian thukimpui ahile ahi ngawl a tel nopna in, aitaa in, nalamdang lakna khat a vawt tu in ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in, “Nitum laitakin ‘Van san ahikom, khua pha vak’ na ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang zingtuung in ‘Van san a, niim ahikom nguazu vak’ na ci uh hi. Van en in khuahunte sonkhol thei nu hi, ahihang hi hunte taw kisai in limte na khia thei bua uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi hun ah mihingte bangza in khansia a Pathian um ngawl ziam? Nalamdang lakna hong ngen na hi uh ziam? Vawt ngawl tu khi hi! Jonah nalamdang lakna khat sia bekma note tungah hong kipia tu hi,” ci hi. Tuaciang, amate nusia in paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nungzuite tuili ngalkhat ah a pai uh ciangin anluum a ken tu mangil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesus in, “Kidawm vun; Pharisee te le Sadducee te ii tol panin kidawm tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate kikum uh a, “Hi bang a hong ci sia anluum ih ken ngawl hang ahi ka tawm,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesus in amate bang teng kikum ci in he a, “Banghangin anluum na nei ngawl uh teng po kikum nu ziam? Na upna uh bangza no ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tel thei ngawl lalai na hi uh ziam? Anluum nga baltham in mihing tulnga in a neak lai in, khum bangza dimh kana nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang anluum sali sia mihing tulli in bangbangin ne kana ziam? Khum bangza dimh kana nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahile anluum huvau ka sonna hi ngawl ahi hunlam tel thei ngawl nu ziam? Pharisee te le Sadducee te ii tol panin kikeam tavun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang nungzuite in anluum sung a tolte pan a kikep tu thuson hi ngawl a, Pharisee te le Sadducee te ii hilna panin kikep natu son ahi hunlam tel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesus in Caesarea Philippi khuahui ngamkhen ah pai a, tua munah, “Mihing Tapa sia ngual in akua ci ziam?” ci in a nungzuite dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Pawlkhat in Tuiphumpa John hi hong ci a pawlkhat in Elijah hi hong ci hi, tuaciang a dangte in Jeremiah ahibuale kamsaang dang khat hi vak hong ci uh hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Note in kei sia akua hi nong ci uh ziam?,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Simon Peter in zo a, “Nang sia Messiah, a nungta Pathian Tapa na hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesus in, “John tapa Simon awng, nang sia mihing hampha khat na hi hi! Hi thutak sia mihing chi le sa sung pan nang tung a hong pai ahi bua a, vantung a ka Pa kung pan in, hong kipia thu ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tuaciang, a maan takin kong ci ciang, Peter awng: nang sia suangpi na hi hi, tuaciangin, hi suangpi phungkawng tungah ka pawlpi ka phut tu a, thina ngawngawn zongh in a zo zo buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vantung ngam tawtangte nang kong pia tu a, leitung a na khakte vantung ah kikhak tu a, leitung a na honte vantung ah kihon tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, ama sia Messiah ahi hunlam kuama munah a son ngawl natu in a nungzuite munah thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun panin kipan a nungzuite munah Jesus in thiang takin son a, “Jerusalem ah ka pai kul tu a, upate, thiampi liante le Thukham hil syate tung panin, nasia takin thuak tu khi hi. Hong kithatlum tu a, ahihang, ni thum zawkciang, nuntakna sungah hong kiphongto kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Peter in Jesus sia samtuamin teih hi. “Topa awng, tuabangin na thuak tu sia Pathian in hong khaam tahen! Tuabang peuma in, nang tungah hong piang heak hen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesus kingeilee in, Peter munah, “Kei kung panin tai in, Satan awng! Nang sia kei mai hong khaktan na hi hi, banghang ziam cile hi khua ngaisutnate sia Pathian kung panin hong pai hi ngawlin, mihing pianzia sung pan hong pai ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in a nungzuite munah, “Khat po in kei hong zui nuam le ama le ama kinial in, a thinglamtee pua in, ka nung hong zui tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, a nuntakna a huu nuam sia in taan tu a, ahihang kei hu a, a nuntakna a taan sia in nuntakna mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihing khat in leitung theampo a nga zonghin, ama nuntakna a taan le bang meetna nei tu ziam? Meet ngawl tu hi! Ama nuntakna a nga kiksak natu a piak thei khat zongh om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Mihing Tapa in Pa vaangletna le a vantunglalangte taw hong pai ciangin, ama in mihing khat sim ii a sepna babangin thaman pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tatak kong ci ciang, hi lai ah a om mihing pawlkhatte ahile, Mihing Tapa Kumpipa in hong pai a mu mateng in a thi buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni luk zawkciang Jesus in Peter, James le John te unau samin mual tungah paipui to a tua munah amate teng nguak om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate mu tangin meal kikhealna sia Jesus tungah hong piang hi: a maitang sia ni bangin taang a, a puansilhte sia tee velvol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus sia Moses le Elijah taw thu son khawmin a om uh nungzui thumte in mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom Peter in, “Topa hi munah ih om sia bangza in nuam ziam? Na uuk le nang atu buk khat, Moses atu buk khat, le Elijah atu buk khat, puanbuk thum kong saksak tu uh hi,” Jesus munah ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabangin a pau laitakin, a taang meeikaai khat in amate teng tuam a tuaciangin meeikaai sung panin awnging khat in, “Hi sia in ka it ka Tapa hi a, ama tungah ka lungkim hi; a thu na ngai tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nungzuite in tua aw a zaak uh ciangin, amate sia lau mama ahikom lei ah bokcip uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate kungah Jesus hong pai in, amate tham in, “Tho vun, lau heak vun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in a et uh ciang Jesus simngawl kuama dang a mu bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mual tung pan hong tuaksuk kawmin Jesus in, “Mihing Tapa sia thina pan a kithawsak kik mateng hi mukholna sia kuama tungah son heak vun,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang nungzuite in Jesus tungah, “Thukham hil syate in Elijah hong pai masa tu hi banghangin ci ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus in, “Elijah sia hong pai masa takpi tu hi, tuaciang in ama in na theampo kithoai sa in koi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A tatakin ka ci ciang, Elijah hong pai zo a, ahihang mihingte in ama tel ngawl ahikom, ama tungah a uuk uh bang tek po in, ngamta uh hi. Tuasia bangma in, amate in Mihing Tapa zongh vawtsia tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin a nungzuite in ama sia Tuiphumpa John huvau son hi ta a, ci in tel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihonpite kungah amate hong heaksuk kik zawkciangin pasal khat Jesus kungah pai a, a mai ah khupdin in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Topa, ka tapa hong hesuaksak ta'n! Ama butthi thei a, kaikin in, mei sungah ahibuale tui sungah puksuk thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na nungzuite kungah ka paipui uh hangin, amate in damsak thei ngawl uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Bangza ta in upna nei ngawlin a khial mihingte hi nu ziam! No taw bang tan vei hong omkhawm tu khi ziam? A bang tanvei hong dual zo tu khi ziam? Patang sia keima kungah hong paipui tavun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesus in doai tungah thupia a, tuasia ciangin patang sung pan doai pusuak a, tua hun lian ma in a patang sia dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate nguakin a om laitak, nungzuite Jesus kungah hong pai a, “Banghangin doai hi sia notkeak thei ngawl khu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesus in, “Banghang ziam cile noma in upna kicing nei ngawl nu hi. A tatakin kong ci ciang, ankamhtang cia upna nei hi le uhte hi mual munah, ‘Hi sung panin zialai ah kikhiin in,’ ci in sawl le uhte kikhiin tu hi. Na khat pawpo na vawt thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thungetna le an tanna in, hite pawl notkeak zo bek a, nadang in notkeak zo ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nungzuite theampo Galilee ah hong kikhop uh ciangin, Jesus in amate tungah, “Mihing Tapa sia mihingte khut sungah thalup tu in ki aap dektak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua mihingte in ama sia thatlum tu hi. Ahihang ni thum zawkciangin ama nuntakna sungah kiphongto kik tu hi,” ci hi. Nungzuite sia khuangai mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Capernaum khua ah Jesus le a nungzuite hong thet uh ciangin, Biakinn atu shiadongte hong pai a, Peter munah, “Na syapa in Biakinn atu shia a pia ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Pia hi,” ci in Peter in zo hi. Peter inn sungah a tum zawkciang, Jesus pau masa a “Simon awng, nang ngaisutna bangbang ahi ziam? Hi leitung kumpite tungah akua bangte in sum zuakna tung pan shia pia ziam? Ngamsung mite in pia ziam maw ngamdangmite in pia ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ngamdangmite in pia hi,” Peter in ci hi. “Pha hi, tua ahile ngamsung mite in piak kul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang mihingte thin uuksak nuam bua hing. Tua ahikom tuili ah va pai ta'n a, ngasa tangthaak ta'n. Ngasa a awk phitbel sia manin, a kam sung en lete, dangkatang khat om tu hi. Biakinn shia piak tu in kei atu le nang atu kicing tu hi. Va la ta'n a, ih shiate amate va pia ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin a nungzuite sia Jesus kungah hong pai a, “Vantung ngam sungah akua lianbel ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus in patang khat samin, amate mai ah dingsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“A tatakin kong ci ciang kikheal in patangte bang na suak bua uh le Vantung ngam sungah na tum thei buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vantung ngam sungah a lianbel sia in, ama le ama kiniamkhiak a, hi patang bang ahite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciangin hi bang patang khat kei min taw a saangte in, keima hong saang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mihing khat po in patang khat ii kei hong upna a lalsak le, tua pa ngawng ah an ngoaina suangpheak kikhii in tuipi thukna sungah kikhiasuk le phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihingte upna a lalsak thei nate om ahikom, hi leitung atu bangza in kiitakhuai ziam? Tuabangte sia hong piang tawntung tu hi, ahihang tuabang a piangsakte atu in, bangza in lauhuai ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na khut ahibuale na peang in, na upna hong taansak le saattan in vawk in! Tawntung meikuang sungah khutcing peangcing hong kibum sangin, nuntakna sungah khutsamh peangsamh in tum lete phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang mittang khat in na upna hong taansak le, khelkeak in vawk in! Hell meikuang sungah mittangte ngeal taw hong kibumsuk sangin mittang langkhat sel in, nuntakna sungah tum lete nang atu in, phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hi patang khat po na zawnsak ngawl natu in, na kidawm vun. Amate ii vantunglalangte sia ka Pa omna munah om tek nginge hi, ci in hong son ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Mihing Tapa sia a bote hun tu in hong pai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mihing khat in tuu zakhat a nei sung pan, tuu khat a bosua sia in bang law tu in na um uh ziam? Ama in a om lai tuu sawmkua le kua mual tungah taasakin nusia a, a bosua tuu sia zong tu in kuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in tua tuu a bosua sia a mu ciangin, a bo ngawl sawmkua le kua tungah a lungdamna sangin, hi a bosua tuu khat tungtaang ah lungdam zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabang ma in vantung a na Pa in, hi patangte khat po a bo tu sia a oai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Na suapuipa in nang tungah hong khial le, va pai ta'n a, ama khialna teng lak ta'n. Noma tuamin kilemtua tavun. Na thu hong ni a ahile na suapuipa na nga kik zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang hong ni nuam buale, ngualdang khat le nii mai ah son pui in, tua hile laithiangtho ci bangin, ‘na mawsakna teng sia mihing nii le a tamzaw in tetti in hong pang tu hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciangin amate zongh in, a sonpui thei bua lai le, pawlpi bup mai ah a vekpi in son siat tavun. Pawlpi thu zongh a ni nuam bua ahile, ama sia doai biate khat bang ahizong, shiadongpa bang ahizong ngaisun tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tua ahikom na vekpi tungah hong ci khi hi: leitung ah na kha uhte vantung zongh ah kikhak tu hi; leitung ah na hon uhte vantung zongh ah kihon tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Thudang kong son lai natu panin, mihing nii in leitung ah na khat pawpo tungtaang ah thukim in thu a ngen uh le, vantung ka Pa in hong vawtsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ka min taw nii le thum kikhopna sungah amate taw ka omkhawm hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang Peter in Jesus kungah pai a, “Topa, ka suapuipa in ka tungah hong khial kikik le bang tanvei maisak tu khi ziam? Salivei dong ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Salivei dong hi ngawlin, sali mun sawmsalivei dong, maisak in,” Jesus in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Banghang ziam cile Vantung ngam sia hi bang ahi hi. Khatvei lai in kumpipa khat in a naseamte sazian sit tu in khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi bangin vawt tu a kipat ciangin, amate sung panin, talen awn tam mama leiba nei khat hong kipaipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Naseampa in a liau tu sum nei ngawl hi. Tua ahikom Kumpipa in, tua pa ii zi taw a tate taw a neisa theampo taw sila a zuak tu in thupia hi. A leiba kilo natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa mai ah naseampa khupdin hi. ‘Thinsau takin hong ngak lai ta'n, kong bat theampo hong lo kik tu khi zam,’ ci in ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa zongh in ama sia khuangaihuai sa in, a leiba teng maisakin ciasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tuaciangin tua naseampa pusuak in, ama tungah sum tawm a ba naseam dang khat taw kisi uh hi. Tua pa sia manin a tawlsaan a, ‘Sum nong bat teng hong lo ta'n,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A naseppuipa in a mai ah bokin ‘Thinsau takin hong ngak lai ta'n; sum kong bat teng hong lo siat tu khi zam,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong ama in za nuam ngawlin, a leiba a lo siat dong thong sungah khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Naseam dangte in, thupiang teng a mu ciangin, a thinnuam ngawlin, kumpipa kungah pai in thupiang theampo son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in naseampa sam a, ‘Nang a mannung ngawl silapa awng, ka tungah nong bat theampo hong maisak ta'n ci in nong nget hu in, hong maisak siat khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nang kong hesuak bangin, na naseppuipa na hesuak tu kilawm hi ngawl ziam?’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kumpipa thin uuk mama a, naseampa in ama tungah a bat theampo a lo siat dong thongtaak tu in puak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesus in a thukhupna ah, “Na thin tak taw na suapuipa na maisak buale vantung ah a om ka Pa in mihing sim tungah tuabangin hong vawt tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in hi teng a ci zawkciang, Galilee ngam nusia in Jordan ngun ngalkhat Judea ngam ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihonpi in zui a, tua munah amate damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pharisee te pawlkhat in, ama aitaa nuam ahikom hi bangin dongh uh hi. “Pasal khat in a zi sia bang thu po taw ahizong a khul nuam le khul thei hi ci thu, ih thukham in a oai ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“A kipatciil in Bitphuapa in mihing sia pa khat le numei khat vawt hi, ci in a ki at laithiangtho sia sim ngeingawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciangin hi thu hangin, ‘Pasal in a pa le a nu nusia tu a, a zi taw kingawm in, amate ngeal sia khat suak tu hi,’ Pathian in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tua ahikom amate sia nii hi nawn ngawlin khat suak hi. Tua ahikom Pathian ii ngawmsa sia mihing in khen thei ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pharisee te in, “Tua ahile banghang Moses in, Pasal in a zi a khul le kikhulna lai pia tahen, ci in thukham vawt ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesus in, “Moses in zi khul thei natu thu hong pia hi, banghang ziam cile noma sia hil hak mama nu hi. Ahihang bitphua ciil hunin tuabang thu om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tatakin kong ci ciang, pasal khat in a zi sia, vaang kitan ngawlna simngawl, thudang taw a khul a, numei dang a teenpui le ama in palngul mawna vawt ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nungzuite in ama tungah, “Pasal le zi kilaklaw ah ngamtat natu sia tu a bang ahi thong le kiteang bualeang phazaw hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus in, “Hi kihilna sia mihing theampo atu kici ngawl a, Pathian ii piakte atu bek hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile pate ii zi a nei thei ngawl natu thu tam mama om hi; pawlkhat sia a nei thei ngawl tu in piang hi; pawlkhat sia ngual in tuabang tu ma in vawt hi; tuaciang pawlkhat in Vantung ngam thu hangin nei ngawl hi. Hi kihilna a saang theite in, tuabangin ngamta tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhat in patangte tungah khut nga a, thungetsak tu in Jesus kungah paipui uh hi; ahihang nungzuite in tua mihingte teih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus in, “Patangte ka kungah hong pai tahen, khaam heak vun, banghang ziam cile Vantung ngam sia tuabangte atu ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate tungah a khut nga a tua zawkciangin paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khatvei lai in Jesus kungah pasal khat hong pai hi. “Sya awng, tawntung nuntakna nga natu in, bang nasep pha ka seam tu ziam?” ci in Jesus dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A banghangin naphate huvau kei tungah hong dongh ni ziam? A pha khat bekma om hi. Nuntakna sungah na tum nuam le thupiakte tang in,” Jesus in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in “A bang thupiakte ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Jesus in “Mihing that heak in, palngul mawna vawt heak in, ngu heak in, leilot thu taw ngual suanhkhial heak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />na pa le na nu zakta in, nangma le nangma na ki it bangin na innpaamte zongh it in,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hi thupiakte theampo ka zui siat sa hi,” khangnopa in ci hi. “A dang bang ka sep tu kul lai ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesus in ama munah, “Na cialcing nuam le, va pai ta'n a, na neisa theampo zuak in, sum na nga teng a zawngte pia ta'n, tua hile vantung ah na hau tu hi; tua zawkciang ka nung hong zui ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khangnopa in hi thu teng a zaak ciangin khuangai in paisan hi, banghang ziam cile ama hau mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzuite munah “A tatakin ka ci ciang sumhaute Vantung ngamsung a thet tu sia haksa mama tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kong ci kik hi: kalaoh khat phin bilvang sungah a tum tu sangin sumhaute Pathian Ngam sungah a tum tu sia haksa zaw lai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nungzuite in hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, amate lungmang mama uh hi. “Tuabang hi thong le akua peuma ngupna nga thei tu ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesus in amate tangtan in en a, “Mihing atu in suak thei ngawl ahihang Pathian atu na khat pawpo suak thei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciang Peter in, “En in, na theampo nusia in nang hong zui khu hi, bang ka nga tu uh ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesus in, “A maan takin kong ci hi. Mihing Tapa sia hong pai tu Khang Thak hun sungah minthanna kumpi tokhum tungah hong to ciangin, no kei hong zui sawm le niite zongh kumpi tokhum tungah to in Israel minam sawm le niite na uk tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaciang a kuama po kei hu in, a inn, a suapuipate, a suapuinute, a pa, a nu, a tate, a leitang khat pawpo a nusiate in, a see zakhat sangin tamzaw in saang tu a, tawntung nuntakna kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang tu laitak a masate hong nungkhak tu a, tu laitak a nungkhakte hong masa tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Vantung ngam sia hi bang hi. Khatvei lai in pasal khat in a sapithuan sungah diang tu in, mihing pawlkhat cial tu in, zingtuungin kuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kipia ngeiza ngunn dangka pheak khat tek piak tu in, thukim in a cial te sia sapithuan sungah kuansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zingsang nai kua sa in sumzuakna a pai ciang, mihing pawlkhat nasep nei ngawlin om mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate munah, ‘No zongh sapithuan sungah diang tavun, a kilawm bangin, nitha hong pia tu khi hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate kuan uh hi. Tuaciang sun nai sawm le nai nii sa ciang le nitak nai thum sa ciangin tuabang ma in mihing cial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nai nga saat dektak ciangin, sumzuakna munah a pai le, midang pawlkhat a ding thawthong mu leleau hi. ‘Banghangin naseam ngawlin ni khat bup hi sungah na hun bosak thawthong nu ziam?’ ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Kuama in hong cial ngawl hi,’ ci uh hi. ‘Tua ahile no zongh sapithuan sungah diang tavun,’ ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nitak ciangin huan neipa in a tha lampuipa munah, ‘Naseamte va sam tavun a, a nitha uh pia ta'n, a khakbel a kicialte pan panin pia ta'n a, a kicial masate pia khak tan’ ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nai nga ciangin nasep kipante sia, ngun dangkatang khat tek pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom a kicial phitbelte in, thaman saang tu hong pai uh ciang dangka tamzaw nga tu in ki um uh hi; ahizong amate zongh ngunn dangkatang khat tek ma kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in a sum saan uh ciang, thacialpa phunsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘A khakbel a kicialte in, nai khat bek seam hi, ko sia nitangtumin sun nisa sungah diang khu hi, ahitazong ko nong piak za ma amate pia ni hi!’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuasia ciang, ‘Lawmte awng, hong ngai tavun, hong theam ngawl khi hi. Ngaisun le uhte ni khat bup thaman tu ngunn dangkatang khat taw lungkim a kong cialte na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu in na ni thaman uh la in cia tavun. A khakbel a kicial hi sia pa zongh, no kong piak za ma pia nuam khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima sum tungtaang ah ka uuk bang po in, zeak thei natu thunei hi kana ngawl khi ziam? Ngo takin ka piakte banghangin eang nu ziam?’ ci in zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesus in a thukhupna ah, “Tua ahiciang a khakte masa tu a, a masate khak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesus in Jerusalem khua sang zuanin, a pai ciang, lampai kawmin a nungzuite munah thu son tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ngai vun, Jerusalem khua ah ih paito tu a, tua munah Mihing Tapa sia, thiampi liante le Thukhamhil syate tungah ki aap tu hi. Amate in, ama tungah thalup natu in thukhen tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Gentile te tungah aap tu a, tuate in selno zazaan in, vel tu a, thatlum tu hi; ahihang ni thum zawkciangin, ama sia nuntakna sungah tho kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang Zebedee zi sia a tate nii taw Jesus kungah pai a, a mai ah kun in huna khat ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Bang nuam ni ziam?” ci in Jesus in dongh hi. “Kumpi na sua ciangin, hi ka tate nii sia khat na ziatsang ah khat na veisang ah, na tosak natu in, kamciam hong pia ta'n,” ci in nupi nu in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tapate nii munah Jesus in, “Na nget uh sia bang ziam ci in tel ngawl nu hi. Hi thuakna hai ka dawn tu sia dawn zo natu nu ziam,” ci hi. “Dawn zo tu khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ka hai sia dawn takpi tu nu hi, ahihang ka ziatsang le ka veisang a to tute sia kei teal thei hi ngawl hi. Hi munte sia ka Pa ii see sa mite atu ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nungzui dang sawm teng in hi thu a zaak ciangin, tua unaute nii tungah amate thin uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus in amate khawmtua a, “Leitung mihing uliante in a khutnuai a omte tungah uk theina thu nei a, lampuite in thuneina theampo nei hi, ci in na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahizong hi thu sia note zui tu ngeina hi ngawl tu hi. Note sungah khat in a lianbel a suak nuam le ama sia note ii naseam hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Note sungah lampui a suak nuamte na sila hi tu hi —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihing Tapa in ngual na sawl tu in hong pai ngawl a, naseam tu le a nuntakna pia in, mihing tam mamate tan tu in hong pai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesus le a nungzuite in Jericho khua a nusiat ciang, mihonpi khat in zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lampi hui ah a to mittaw nii in Jesus hong pai hi ci in a zaak ciangin, “David Tapa awng, ko hong hesuak ta'n, Topa awng,” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mipite in amate teih in, a ngamlum ngawl natu in a sawl uh hang, amate a nging seseam in au a, “David Tapa awng, ko hong hesuak ta'n, Topa,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesus in amate nii sam a, “Bang hong vawtsak leng na uuk uh ziam,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Topa awng, khua nong musak tu uuk ung,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesus in amate sia khuangai huai sa in, a mitte thamsak a; thakhatin, amate khuamu thei a, amate in ama zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus le nungzuite in Jerusalem khua hong nai uh a, Olive Mual, Bethphage a kicina mun hong theng hi. Tua munah Jesus in, a nungzuite nii sawlin paikholsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hi bangin thupia hi; “Na mai a om khuano sia ah pai tavun, tua munah laapui khat kikhii in om thakhat thu in na mu tu uh a, laano zongh a pui kungah om tu hi. A khau suutin a nii in keima kungah hong paipui tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang khat po in, bang khat po hong cile ‘Topa in tulmaw hi’: ci po le uhte thakhatin hong tha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi bangin a pian theina sia kamsaangpa sonna teng a taangtut natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zion khuapi munah son vun, En vun, na kumpipa no kungah hong pai hi! Ama kiniamkhiak in laa tungah to a, laapui ii ta laano tungah to hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom nungzuite in Jesus sawl bangin pai in vawt uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />laa le laano hong paipui uh a, a laktong puasilh uh dapin, Jesus sia a tungah to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihonpi in a laktong puasilh uh lampi ah pha in a dangte in thingsawl saatin, lam tungah pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesus mai le a nung panin a pai mihonte in, “David Tapa minthang hen! Topa min taw hong pai pa tungah Pathian in thupha pia tahen! Hosanna, Pathian in pokna nga tahen!” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem khua sungah Jesus hong tum ciang, a khuathing ngamlum lialua uh hi. “Ama sia akua ziam?” ci in mipite in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hisia pa sia Galilee ngam Nazareth pan kamsaangpa Jesus hi,” ci in mihonte in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Biakinn sungah Jesus tumin vanh lei vanh zuak theampo notkeak hi. Sum theakte ii sabuai le vakhu zuakte ii tokhumte sawnthalsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuaciang, “Laithiangtho sungah Pathian in, ‘Ka Biakinn sia thungetna inn’ kici tu hi, ci hi, ahihang note in ngutate bukna na suaksak uh hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mittaw le peangbai te Biakinn sung ama kungah hong pai uh a, amate damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thiampi liante le Thukhamhil syate in, Jesus ii nalamdang a vawt hu le, patangte ii “David Tapa tungah Hosanna, kipok tahen!” a ci hu in amate thin uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in Jesus munah, “Amate in bang teng ci ziam, na za ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Ka za takpi hi, laithiangtho sungah sim ngeingawl nu ziam? ‘A cialcing pokna a pia thei tu in Patangte le nausente na sinsak zo hi,’ ” ci in Jesus in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesus in amate nusia in Bethany zuan tu in, khuapi puasia ah paisuak a tua munah zantaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zingtuungin khua sung sang hong zot kik ciang, Jesus a ngilkial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in lamhui ah theikung khat mu in vil a, ahihang a tee simngawl bangma a mu bua hi. Tua ahikom thingkung tungah, “Nang sia nga kik thei nawn ngawl tu ni hi!” ci hi. Thakhat thu in theikung kongaw cip paih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nungzuite in a mu ciangin lamdang sa uh hi. “Banghang hi za in kocip paih thei ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesus in “A tatakin kong ci ciang, um in muang la bua po le uhte hi thei tungah ka vawt bangin na vawt thei tu uh hi. Hisia bek zongh hi ngawlin, hi mual munah, ‘Tho to in a, tuipi sungah kilawnsuk in,’ ci le uhte, tuabang ma in hong hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na um uh le thungetna taw na nget uh po na nga tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biakinn sungah Jesus heak kik a, hilna a nei ciangin, thiampi liante le upate in, “Hi bang na sep thei natu in bang thuneina nei ni ziam? Akua in hi thunei theina hong pia ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesus in, “Kei zongh kam khat hong dongh tu khi hi, tuasia nong zo thei uh le a bang thuneina taw hite seam khi ziam cisia kong son tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“John ii baptize piak theina thu sia, koisung pan hong pai ziam? Pathian tung pan ziam maw mihing tung pan ziam?” ci hi. Amate teng kinial uh a, “Bangbang ci tu hi ziam? ‘Pathian tung pan ci tu hi leang, tua ahile banghangin John sia um ngawl nu ziam?’ hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ahihang ‘mihing tung pan’ ci thong leang, mipite kiitakhuai hi, banghang ziam cile amate theampo in John sia kamsaang khat hi ci in saang hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in Jesus munah, “He ngawl khu hi,” ci uh hi. Tuasia ciangin, amate tungah Jesus in, “Kei zongh hite bang thuneina taw vawt khi ziam ci in kong son buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tu in hi thu bangbang na ngaisun uh ziam? Khatvei lai in pasal khat in tapa nii nei hi. A tapa lianzaw sia kungah ama pai in, ‘Ka tapa awng, sapithuan ah tu ni in na kuan ta'n,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Uuk ngawl khi hi’ ci napi a zawkciangin a thin kikheal kik in kuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a pa in a tapa dang khat sia munah tuabang ma in sawl hi. Tua a tapa in, ‘Pa awng, hi tahen,’ ci napi a kuan bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tapate nii sung pan akua in a pa thu ni zaw ziam?” ci hi. “A tapa lianzaw sia in ni zaw hi” ci uh hi. Tuaciang Jesus in amate tungah, “Kei kong ci in ah: Shiadongte le numei paktatte in Pathian Ukna ngam sungah note sangin theng masa zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Tuiphumpa John hong pai a, thumaan lampi hong hil napi, ama na um bua uh hi; ahihang shiadongte le numei paktatte in um uh hi. Hite na mu zawk ngawngawn in, na thin uh kikheal in na um nuam bua uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jesus in “Thusonteena dang khat ngai vun,” ci hi. “Khatvei lai in leitang nei khat in, sapithuan khat vawt a, a kiimkot dal vawtin, sapittui suuk natu dum to a, lo hun natu teitaan khat vawt hi. Tua zawkciang a lo tuasia saapthawsak tu in, ngual a aap zawkciang, ama khualhaw tu in ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sapit nga law hun ciangin, ama tel tu teng a saang tu in, huanthote munah a silate paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huanthote in silate man a, khat sia saatin, khat sia that uh a, khat sia suangtum taw deang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Leitang neipa in a silate a tamzaw paisak leleau hi, ahihang huanthote in a masate tungah a ngamtat uh bangma in, taa kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A khakbel ciangin, ‘Ka tapa buang hong zataksak tu zam,’ ci in, a tapa sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahihang huanthote in a tapa a mu uh ciangin, ‘Hisia huan neipa tapa hi. Hong pai tavun, thatlum tu hi; tua hile a neisa teng ih tang thei tu hi!’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama man in, sapithuan pua sangah a lot zawkciang, thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Tu in huan neipa sia sapithuan sungah hong pai tak ciangin huanthote bang law tu ziam?” ci in Jesus in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Ama in tua misiate thatlum nanak tu a, a hun zui in, thaw ante, ama saan tu bangin a pia tu ngualdangte tungah sapithuan sia saapthaw tu in aap tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesus in, “Laithiangtho ci thu sia sim ngeingawl nu ziam? ‘Inn sate ii mannung ngawl a sak a nil suangtum sia a kizanghbel suangtum hong suak hi. Hi thu in Topa ii nasep na hi a; ih mu ciangin lamdang mama hi!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Tua ahikom kong ci hi, Pathian Ngam sia no kung pan in, kila tu a, nga pha a piangsak mihingte tungah kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hi suang tungah a taak sia akua po ahizong zaantham in vui tu hi; tua suang sia khat po ii tungah a taak ahile tua pa zaantham in thi tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Pharisee te le thiampi liante in Jesus thuson nate za uh a, amate a cinopna ahi hunlam tel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama sia mat sawm uh a, ahihang amate in mihonpite kiita uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Jesus sia kamsaang khat hi ci in ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in mihingte munah thusonteenate zangh kikin thu son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Vantung ngam thu sia hi bang ahi hi. Khatvei lai in kumpipa khat in a tapa atu mopoai anneakna khat vawt tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a naseamte sawl a mopoai hong siim natu in, khualhilsak hi. Ahihang amate pai nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom naseam dangte paisak a, khual a kihilte munah hi bang sawl hi. ‘Ka poai sia tu in a kipan thei tu hi zo hi; ka khuital le ka khuino thaute kingo zo hi, na theampo kinging sa in om zo hi. Mopoai ah hong pai tavun!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang khual a kihilte in awlmawk ngawlin amate nasep tek ma sep san uh hi: khat in a lokuan a, a dang khat in a sumbuk ah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a dangte in kumpipa naseamte pummat a, velin thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa thin uuk mama ahikom a ngalkapte paisak a, mihing that te thatlum in a khuapi halthapsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a naseamte sam a, ‘Ka mopoai kipat thei lian tu in, om zo ahihang ka khualhil sate mopoai taw kiphu ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu in lam ziikpite ah pai tavun a, mihing na mu zaza uh sam tavun,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom naseamte in lam ziikpite ah pai in a mu theampo le mihing pha mihing sia a kibangin khawmtua uh hi; tuaciang in mopoai vawtna inn dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kumpipa sungtang in a leangnate a et ciang, mopoai puan silh ngawlpa khat mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Lawm awng, mopoai puan silh ngawlin hi sungah bangbangin hong tum thei ni ziam?’ ci in dongh hi. Ahihang tua pa in a zo natu a he bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa in naseamte munah, ‘Hisia pa a khut a peang sawmcip vun a, doipua khuazingna ah vawk tavun. Tua munah ama kapin ha ngoai tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus in a thukhupna ah, “Tam mama kisam tu a tawm bek kiteal tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharisee te pai a, kam doknate taw Jesus aitaa sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in, a nungzuite pawlkhat le Herod mihingte pawlkhat paisak uh hi. “Sya awng, thumaan na son hi ci in hong he khu hi. Pathian ii mihingte atu a deisak thutakte, mihingte in bang ngaisun ci patau ngawlin na hil hi. Banghang ziam cile mihingte maitang na zakta bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangbang ngaisun ni ziam?, Rome Kumpilianpa shia ih piak tu sia, ih Thukham taw kisi ziam, kisi ngawl ziam? hong son tan?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in amate thinsung ah, thusia a sawmna, he ahikom, “A kihitheamsakte awng! banghangin hong aitaa nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Shia piak tu sumtang sia hong lak tavun,” ci hi. Amate in sumtang a kungah paipui uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesus in, “Hite akua lim le akua min ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Kumpilianpa aa hi” ci in zo uh hi. Tua ahikom Jesus in, “Pha hi, Kumpilianpa sum sia Kumpilianpa na pia vun a, Pathian sum sia Pathian na pia vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi thu a zaak uh ciangin amate in lamdang sa uh hi; tua ciangin ama nusia in paisan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni in Sadducee te pawlkhat Jesus kungah hong pai uh a, “Mihingte in thina pan tho kik ngawl tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Syapa awng, Moses ii cina panin, pasal khat sia ta nei ngawlin a thi le a suapuipa in meingongnu sia teenpui tahen, tua hile ta a nei uh ciang, mithipa ta bangin, kingaisun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu in hi sungah unau pa sali om ngei hi. A lianbel sia in zi nei in ta nei ngawlin thi a meingongnu sia, a suapuipa in lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuabang ma in a niina a thumna panin kipan a salina dongin ta nei ngawlin thi uh a, meingongnu lua susuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A khakbel ciangin meingongnu zongh thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu in mithite thaw kik ni ciangin tua numei sia akua ii zi hi tu ziam? A vekpi in ama teenpui ngei tek hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesus in, “Pathian ii vaangletna le Laithiangtho na heak ngawl uh hu in bangza in khial nu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mithite a thaw kik ciang, vantung ah a om vantunglalangte bang hi tu a, kiteenna om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu in mithite thaw kikna thu, Pathian hong son thute sim ngeingawl nu ziam? Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Keima in Abraham ii Pathian, Isaac ii Pathian, Jacob ii Pathian ka hi hi,’ ci hi. Ama in a nungtate Pathian hi a, a thisate Pathian ahi bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mihonte in hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, a hilnate lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sadducee te a pau natu a heak ngawl dongin, Jesus in a koi zawkciang, Pharisee te hong kikhawmtua uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />amate sung panin, Thukham hil sya khat in, Jesus sia thudokna khat taw aitaa sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Sya awng, Thukham sung teng pan a lianbel le a thupibel thupiak sia koisia ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesus in, “ ‘Na Topa Pathian sia na thin theampo, na thaa theampo le na ngaisutna theampo taw it in.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hisia in a lianbel le a thupibel Thupiak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A niina a thupibel Thupiak sia tuasia taw ma in kibang hi: ‘Nangma le nangma na ki it bangin midangte zongh na it in.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Moses Thukham buppi le kamsaangte hilna theampo sia hi thu niite kibulphu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pharisee te pawlkhat a kikhop uh ciangin Jesus in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Messiah huvau bangbangin ngaisun nu ziam? Ama akua ii suan ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Ama sia David suan hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesus in “Tua ahile banghangin Thaa in David munah, ‘Topa’ cisak ziam?” ci in dongh hi. David in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />‘Topa in ka Topa munah: Na ngalte na peang nuai ah ka koi dong, hi sung ka ziatsang ah hong to ta'n,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“David in ama sia ‘Topa’ ci ahile Messiah sia bangbangin, David ii suan hi thei tu ziam?” ci in Jesus in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesus dokna kuama in a zo thei bua uh a, tua ni pan kipan kuama in ama thu a dongh ngam nawn bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in mipite tung le nungzuite tungah thu son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thukham hil syate le Pharisee te sia Moses Thukham a pheen thei tu, thu neite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in vawt a hong sawl peuma ni in zui vun; ahihang amate ngamtatnate zui heak vun, banghang ziam cile amate in a hil uh bangin ngamta ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihingte ii nungzaang ah vanhngit a puak hakte sia tua mite ma ii sot to ahi hi, ahihang amate in tua vanhngitte puakpui tu in, a khutme dawn zongh a tung nuam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihingte mu tu in amate in na theampo seam uh hi. Amate talki tung le a baante tungah laithiangtho kammal a ki at savun pheakte bangza in beak ziam, en vun! A laktong puasilh mong a teapkaaite zongh bangza in sausak ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Poai sungah amate tona a nuambelte tungah ahizong, synagogue sungah a kikhaam sa tonate tungah ahizong amate in to nuam saap a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />amate in vanhzuakna munah ngual ii paupui tu thangai a, ‘Syapa’ ci in a sap tu uuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note sia ‘Syapa’ kici ngawl tu nu hi, banghang ziam cile note sia unau khat vive hi a, Sya khat bek na nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciangin hi leitung ah kuama ‘Pa awng’ ci heak vun, banghang ziam cile vantung a Pa khat bekma na nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Lampuipa awng,’ zongh na kicisak heak vun, banghang ziam cile Messiah khat bek ma na lampui uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No sungah a lianbel sia in note naseam hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Akua po ama le ama a kiliansak sia kiniamsak tu a, a kuama po a kiniamkhiak sia, thupi in kikoi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Thukham hil syate le Pharisee te awng! Note atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam? No a kihitheamsakte awng! Ngual mai panin, vantung Ngam kongkha khaktan nu hi, tuaciang noma mama in a sungah na tum bua uh a, tum nuam in a hanciamte zongh, a tum tu na oai bua uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thukham hil syate le Pharisee te awng! No atu in bangza lauhuai ziam? A kihitheamsakte awng! Meingongte na zothaw uh a, a inn uh na phuul uh hi. Tua zawkciang na thunget a sau mama in na kivawt tawm uh hi! Tua hu in daan na thuak tu sia nasia mama tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Thukham hil syate le Pharisee te awng! No a kihitheamsakte awng! No atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam? Noma upna sungah mihing khat na nga thei natu in, tuipi tungah pai a, ngam theampo kaantan in pai nu hi; tuaciang tuabangin nungzui khat na nga zawk uh ciang, noma sangin hell ngam sungah a zaa nii in theng tu in a kilawm suaksak nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mittaw ngual lamlakte awng! No atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam? ‘Biakinn taw a kiciamte a kamciam a peal hangin phamaw ngawl hi; ahihang Biakinn sungah khamhte taw a kiciamte sia a kamciam bangin a vawt uh kul hi,’ na ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mittaw mawmawte awng! koisia thupi zaw ziam, khamh hi zaw ziam, khamh a thiangthosak Biakinn sia hi zaw ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kihil thua lai na uh pan, ‘Biaknatau taw a kiciamte sia a ciampeal hangin phamaw ngawl hi; ahihang biaknatau tung a om nate taw a kiciamte sia a kamciam bangin tung tu hi,’ ci nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na mit uh bangza in taw ziam! Biakpiak natu in a kikoi nate thupi zaw ziam maw, tua nate a thiangthosak biaknatau sia thupi zaw ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom mihing khat in biaknatau taw a kiciam le, tua biaknatau le a tung a om na theampo taw ama kiciam ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuaciang Biakinn taw kiciam ciangin tua Biakinn le a sung a teang Pathian taw zongh kiciam hi si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tuaciang khat po in vantung taw a kiciam le Pathian tokhum le a tungah a to pa taw kiciam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thukham hil syate le Pharisee te awng! A kihitheamsakte awng! No atu in bangza lauhuai ziam? An mee sungah hel thei lonamsia, masala le thing namtuite dongin, see sawm sua see khat sia Pathian na pia uh hi, ahihang Thukham sungah a kihil a thupi tatak ahi, thukhaikimna, hesuakna le thumaannate na awlmaw bua uh hi. Hite zongh na zak tu uh hi a, a dangte zongh na awlmawk ngawl tu hisaap ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mittaw ngual lamlakte awng! Na dawn tu uh tui sung pan tho khat po sia nasia takin na chit uh hi; ahihang kalaoh khat na lopvalh uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Thukham hil syate Pharisee te awng! A kihitheamsakte awng! No atu in bangza lauhuai ziam? Hai le kuang sia a puasang teng na sil uh hi, ahizong sungsang sia zawthawk thu le duhopna taw na nga uh nate taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pharisee mittawte awng! Hai sia a sungsang sil phot le uhte a puasang zongh thiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Thukham hil syate le Pharisee te awng! A kihitheamsakte awng! No atu in bangza lauhuai ziam? No sia suangkaangtui taw a kizut thaankul taw kibang nu hi, tuate sia a puasang hoi ahihang a sungsang ah mithi ngu le mithi muat taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in no sia a pua sang panin a kuama po ii muna ah a hoi bang na hi uh hi, ahihang na sungsang uh ahile kihi thepsakna le mawna taw kidim nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Thukham hil syate le Phariseete! A kihitheamsakte awng! No atu in bangza lauhuai ziam? Kamsaangte atu in thaankuul sia a et hoi tu in na vawt uh a, miphate atu in, tepteena khan sia na zepsak uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciangin ka taanghpupite khan lai in, a nungtate hi le ung amate ii septe seam buan ci ung, kamsaangte that buan ci ung, ci nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahikom kamsaangte a thatlumte ii suante na hi uh hunlam noma pauna panin kipholaak na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahiciang na taanghpupite ii patsa nate na zaw dong seam vet tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngul le ngul ii suante awng, hell sungah hong kikhiak suk natu panin, bangbangin suakta tu in ki um nu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ahikom, kamsaangte, mihing ciimte le syate sia note kungah kong paisak tu hi; tuate pawlkhat na thatlum tu uh a, pawlkhat thinglamtee tungah na kilh tu a, pawlkhat sia synagogue inn sungah na vel tu uh a, khuapi khat pan khuapi khat ah na delkot tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua hu in mawna nei ngawl Abel pan a kipan, sangaw na biaknatau le Biakinn kilaklaw a na thalup uh Berechiah tapa Zechariah le mawna nei ngawl bul a na thalup uh theampo hangin thuak tu daan sia note tungah hong tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A tatakin kong ci ciang mihing that theampo hangin na thuak uh daan sia tu hun mihingte ii tungah hong tung tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Jerusalem, Jerusalem awng! Nang in kamsaangte na thatlum a, Pathian kamtaite suangtum taw na hua hi. Akpui in aknote a thakhui nuai ah a uap bangin, bang tanvei na mihingte angvan nuam khi ziam? ahihang na oai bua hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ahikom Biakinn sia kitaisan tu a, a hawm in om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hong ci khi hi; tu pan kipan, ‘Topa min taw hong pai pa sia Pathian in thupha pia tahen,’ na ci uh mateng in, kei nong mu kik nawn buatu hi.” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Biakinn pan Jesus a pusua zawkciang a nungzuite in Biakinn huang sung a inn dangte lak nuam in neak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesus in, “Hi hi, en tek vun. A tatakin kong ci ciang, hi sungah suangte khat zongh a omna ngei san ah om nawn ngawl tu hi; a vekpi kilawn keak siat tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesus in Olive Mual tungah a to laitakin, a nungzuite ama kungah hong pai tuam uh hi. “Hi thu sia bang hun ciangin hong tung tu a, tuaciang nong pai kik tu hun le hun bo tu hun, a lak tu in bang hong piang tu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesus in, “Kidawm tavun, kuama in theamsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mihing tam mamate kei min zanghin hong pai tu a, ‘Keima in Messiah ka hi hi’ ci tu a mihing tam mama theam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A naina ah ngal kidona aw na za tu uh a, a khualana ah ngal kidona thu hong kison tu hi; ahihang patau heak vun. Tuabangte hong piang nanak tu a, ahihang hun bona hong theng zo hi, cina hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngam khat le ngam khat kisim tu hi; kumpi khat le khat kido tu hi. Mun theampo ah kialpi tung tu a, zinliing tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hite theampo sia nautut kipat ciang, a nat bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang note hong kiman tu a, daan piak tu le thalup tu in hong ki aap tu hi. Keima hu in mihing theampo in note hong ngaimaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing tam mama in tua hun ciangin, a upna uh nusia tu hi; amate khat le khat kileeheak tu a, khat le khat kingaimaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang leilot kamsaang tam mama piang tu a, mihing tam mama theam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabangin siatna hong kizel tu a, mihing tam mamate ki itna kiam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang a tawp dong a thumaante kingum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciangin, hi Kumpingam Lungdamna Thupha sia, leitung theampo ah tetti tu in minam theampo tungah kihil kawkoai tu hi; tua zawkciang hun bona hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Kamsaangpa Daniel ii son ‘A kiitakhuai mama sia’ na mu tu uh hi. Tua in a thiangthona munah ding tu hi.” (Hi lai a sim sia in tel tahen!)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuaciang Judea a omte in mual tungah tai tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Innkhum tung a om mihing khat in ama ii vanhte la tu in tuaksuk nawn heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lo sungah a om mihing khat in a laktong puasilh la tu in, heak kik nawn heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hun sungah a om numei naupaaite le nau noailuaite atu in bangza he huai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tai tu uh hun sia phalbi lai le Sabbath ni ahi ngawl natu in Pathian tungah thungen vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile tua hun ah ngimna sia leitung a kipat pan kipan, tuni dong a piang ngei ngimnate theampo sangin nasia zaw pek tu hi. Tuabang ngimna sia maisang zongh ah om kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in a ni sia khiamsuk zo hi; tua hi buale kuama a suakta buatu hi. Ahitazong a tealtuam mihingte atu in Pathian in a ni khiam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tuasia ciang khat po in, ‘En in, hi sungah Messiah om hi!’ ci in ahizong, ‘Zia sungah om hi!’ ci in ahizong hong cile um heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Messiah theam le kamsaang theamte hong piang tu hi; hi thei hile Pathian tealsa mihingte ngawngawn a theam natu in, amate in nalamdang lakna liante le a tumdang nate tam mama hong vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngai vun! a hun hong thet ma in hong sonkhol zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tua ahibuale mihingte in, ‘En vun, ama sia sennealngam sungah om hi!’ hong cile zong, tua munah pai heak vun; tua ahibuale ‘En vun, ama sia hi sungah buu hi,’ hong cile zong na um heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Mihing Tapa sia van buppi ah nisuana pan nitumna dong a kaantan khualeng taang bangin hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Mithi luang omna mun po ah vaciikte kikhawmtua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tua hun ngimnate zawk a hai ngawlin, ni hong taang nawn ngawl tu a, tha zongh taang nawn ngawl tu hi, aksite van panin taaksuk tu a, van ah a om nate sia amate ii zin tek panin kipialsak siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Mihing Tapa ii lim sia van ah hong kilangh tu hi; Mihing Tapa sia van ah meeikaai tung pan vaangletna le minthanna lianpi taw hong pai a mu uh ciangin, leitung mihing theampo kap tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lemlepui aw hong nging tu a, tuaciang ama in leimong king lite ah a vantunglalangte sawl in, amate in ama tealsa mite leimong khat pan mong khat dongin khawmtua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Theikung in hilsak tavun. A baakte zongh hingin hong moisua ciangin, a teeno meang tu in kithoai a, tuasia ciang khuakhaal hun hong nai hi ci in na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in, hite theampo na mu uh ciangin, a hun hong nai a, hong kipapan zo hi, ci in na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tu laitak a nungta mihingte a thi siat ma in, hi thu sia hong piang tu hi ci in phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vantung le simlei a bo tu hi, ahihang ka kammalte a bo ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Ahitazong tua a ni le a nai tu sia kuama in he ngawl hi — vantung ah vantung mite ahizong, Tapa ahizong, he ngawl hi; Pa bek in he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mihing Tapa hong pai natu sia Noah hun lai thupiang bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuipi liim ma in mihingte an ne tui dawnin om a, numei le pa kiteangin, Noah ii teambaw sungah a tum tatak ni dong sia tuabangin om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua hi napi tuiliim a, tui ii a taikeak dongin, bang thu piang ziam ci in amate in a phawk bua uh hi. Mihing Tapa hong pai ciang zong tuabang ma hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin pasal nii sia lo sungah naseam khawm tu hi: khat kila tu a khat kikhe tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Numei nii an ngoaina ah diang tu hi: khat kila tu a, khat kikhe tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“A kingingta sa in om vun, banghang ziam cile Topa hong pai tu ni sia na he bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Inn neipa khat in ngutate ii hong pai hun tu he le, mu ngawlin om tu a, ngutate in inn a phuulsak buatu hi, ci in na heak uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ahiciang no zongh, a tawntung kinging sa in om vun, banghang ziam cile Mihing Tapa in na muanmawk ngawl hun laitakin hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Thumaan a, a ciim naseampa sia akua bangte ziam? Ama sia naseam dangte a uk tu le a hun a hun in an a pia tu in a kikoipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A topa hong cia laitakin a kisawl bang a naseam hi ci in a topa ii mu naseampa sia bangza in lungdam tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A tatakin kong ci ciang, a topa in tua naseampa sia a neisa theampo uk tu in koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahihang tua naseampa sia a ngina ngawl khat ahile, a topa sia hong cia hak lai vak, ci in ama le ama kitheam tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />tuaciangin a nasep khoppui naseam dangte saatin, zukham theite taw, an ne zu ne in om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuaciangin tua naseampa ii topa sia a muanmawk ngawl hun le a heak ngawl ni hun khat ciang hong cia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A topa in ama sia nasia takin ngim pia tu a, a kihitheamsakte ii thuak tu teng thuaksak tu hi. Tua munah ama sia kap in ha ngoai tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tua hun ciangin Vantung ngam sia hi bang hi tu hi. Khatvei lai in ngaknu sawm sia a meivak uh la in, zineipa muak tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngaknu ngate mawmaw a, a dang ngate ciim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mawmaw nga teng in meiinn keng ahihang meitui keng thua ngawl uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a ciimte ahile meiinn atu meitui bung dimin keng thua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zineipa theng hak ahikom, ngaknute lusu in mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Zankim zawkciangin taangkona aw khat hong nging a, ‘Hi sungah zineipa hong pai hi. Hong pai tavun a muak vun,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngaknu sawmte khanglo in a meiinnte puua tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A mawmawte in a ciimte munah, ‘Na meitui uh tawm hong hawm tavun, banghang ziam cile ka meiinnte mit tu hi’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ciimte in, ‘hi thei mama ngawl hi; no atu le ko atu in kicing ngawl hi. Sumbuk ah pai in lei tavun;’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom a mawmaw ngaknute sia meitui lei tu in pai uh hi; tuaciang amate pai lanin zineipa hong theng hi. A kinging sa a om ngaknu nga teng sia ama taw kiteenna poai ah sungtang uh a, tuaciang kongkha kikhak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tua zawkciangin ngaknu dangte hong theng hi. ‘Topa, topa! Hong tumsak ta'n!’ ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Hong tumsak mama ngawl tu khi hi! No hong he ngawl khi hi,’ ci in zineipa in zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tua ahikom kikeam khol vun, banghang ziam cile, a ni tu le a nai tu na he bua uh hi,” ci in Jesus in thukhup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tua hun ciangin Vantung ngam sia hi bang hi tu hi. Khatvei lai in pasal khat in khualhaw sawm hi; a naseamte samin a neisa teng aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing simin amate thiamna om bangin, ama in pia hi: khat ii tungah khamh dangka tulnga pia hi; a dang khat ii tungah tulnii, a dang khat ii tungah tulkhat pia hi. Tua zawkciang ama sia khualhaw tu in ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dangka tulnga a kipia naseampa in, thakhat ma in sumvawt in, a dang tulnga ma nga thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in dangka tulnii a nga sia zongh in, a dang tulnii ma nga thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang dangka tulkhat a nga naseampa in pai a, leidum to in, a topa dangka teng phual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“A khuangei zawkciang naseamte ii topa hong cia kik a, amate sum tepteena tek sit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dangka tulnga a saang naseampa hong pai a, a dang tulnga ama tungah aap hi. ‘Topa, dangka tulnga hong pia ni hi. En in! Hi sungah dangka tulnga ka meetsak hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Pha hi, a thumaan naseam pha pa awng, tawmno na zeakna tungah thumaan na hikom, tampi zeakna ah a uk tu in kong koi tu hi. Kei taw lungdam khawm tu in hong pai ta'n!’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tuaciang tulnii a kipia naseampa hong pai a, ‘Topa, dangka tulnii hong pia ni hi. En in! Hi sungah ka thalaw dangka tulnii om hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Pha hi, a thumaan naseam pha pa awng! Na tawmno tungah thumaan na hikom, na tampite uk tu in, kong koi tu hi. Kei taw lungdam khawm tu in hong pai ta'n!’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tuaciang in dangka tulkhat a saang naseampa hong pai a, ‘Topa, nang sia mihing sonham khat na hi hunlam kong he hi; na tuu ngawlna munah a at pa, na poai ngawlna munah anla pa na hi sia kong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lau ka hikom pai in, lei sungah na sum teng ka phual hi. En in, hi sungah na neisa teng om hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“ ‘A datham misia naseampa awng! Ka tu ngawlna munah at a, ka poai ngawlna munah anlapa hi, ci in hong he na hi ziam?’ a topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Tua ahile pha hi; ka sum teng sia sum kholna munah na koisak po lete, kong cia kik ciang a meet taw a vekpi nga kik tu hi ngawl khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu in a sum laaksak vun a, tulsawm a neipa piaksak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, a neisate tungah a tamzaw kipia thua tu a hau seseam tu hi; ahihang bangma a nei ngawlpa tung pan a nei susun kila tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hi naseam ngina ngawlpa ahile — doipua khuazing sungah not tavun; tua munah kap in ha ngoai tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa sia Kumpi bangin vantunglalangte taw hong pai ciangin, a kumpi tokhum tungah to tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tuaciangin minam theampo ama mai ah kikhawm tu hi. Tua zawkciangin ama in tuu cing khat ii tuu le keal a khen bangin pawl nii in khen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in thumaan thutang mite sia a ziatsang ah koi tu a, a dang teng sia a veisang ah koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaciang Kumpipa in ziatsang a om mihingte munah, ‘Hong pai tavun; Ka pa ii thupha piakte awng! Simlei a kibitphua ciil panin no atu a kipua khol sate lua tu in hong pai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka ngilkial laitakin an nong vaak uh hi, ka dangko laitakin tui nong pia uh hi; zin in ka vak laitakin na inn uh ah zin nong do uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />puansilh ka sel laitakin puan nong khu uh hi; ka ciinat laitakin nong ou uh a, thong sungah nong ve uh hi’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“A thumaan thutang mihingte in, ‘Topa, bang hun in ngilkial a na om hong mu a, an hong vaak ka na khu ziam?, ahibuale na dangko a tui neak tu, bang hun in hong pia kana khu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Khualmi in bang hunin nong vaak a, ka inn uh ah zin hong do ngei khu ziam? ahibuale puansilh sel in bang hunin na om a puan hong khu ngei kana khu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bang hunin na ciinat ahizong, na thongtaak lai ahizong, hong mu ngei a hong ve kana khu ziam?’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kumpipa in, ‘A maan tak ka ci ciang, hi ka suapuite a nobel khat tungah na vawt uh sia kei tung a hong vawt na hi uh hi!’ ci in zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Tuaciangin a veisang a tote munah, ‘Kei kung pan tai vun, no Pathian ii haamsiat sate awng! Doaimangpa le a lalangte atu a kivawt kholsa tawntung meikuang sungah pai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka ngilkial laitakin hong vaak ngawl nu hi, ka dangko laitakin ka neak tu bangma nong pia bua uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />khualmi in ka om a na inn sungah nong saang bua uh hi, puansilh ka sel laitak puan taw nong khu bua uh hi; ka ci a na zong thong ka taak zong, nong ou nong khoi bua uh hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Tuasia ciang amate in, ‘Topa, ngilkial dangtaak a, khualmi in, puansilh sel a ciina le na thongtaak, bang hun hong mu ngei a, hong hu ngawl kana khu ziam?’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kumpipa in, ‘Kei kong cina pan, hi lai ah mihing thupi ngawlbelte khat na hu nop ngawl uh ciang, keima hong hu nuam ngawl na hi uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ahikom hite sia tawntung daan thuak natu sungah kipuak tu a, ahizong a thumaan thutangte sia tawntung nuntakna sungah pai tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in hi thu teng hilna a nei zawkciang a nungzuite munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na heak uh bangma, ni nii zawkciang Paisan Poai hong theng tu a, tuaciang Mihing Tapa sia thinglamtee tungah thalup tu in ki aap tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang, Thiampi Lianbelpa Caiaphas teenna inn ah thiampi liante le upate kisitua uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesus man ku in a thalup thei natu ngeal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Poai hun sungah vawt ngawl tu hi, tuabang hi thong leang, mipite hong ngamlum tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesus sia Bethany khua, a lauhuai vun natna a vei Simon a kici pa ii inn ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesus an a neak laitakin numei khat hong pai a, a manham sathau namtui suangngo thawl dim khat hong keng a, Jesus lu tungah buak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nungzuite in a mu uh ciangin a thin uuk uh hi. “Banghangin hi bangin pakvawt ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hi sathau namtui zuak leang, sum tam mama kinga tu a, mizawngte kipia thei tu hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesus in amate thusonnate za ahikom amate munah, “Banghangin hi sia nu thinnuam maw se nu ziam? Ama in kei atu in nasep pha nasep hoi khat hong seam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing a zawngte sia note taw hong om tawntung tu ahihang kei sia, note taw hong omkhawm tawntung ngawl tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in ka kivui natu in ka pumpi sia paaknamtui hong noai khol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tatakin kong ci ciang, hi lungdamna thu leitung theampo ah a kihil na mun po ah, ama nasep sia ama a kiphawk natu in, kison tawntung tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang nungzui sawm le nii sung pan khat ahi — Judas Iscariot a kici sia — thiampi liante kungah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Jesus hong leeheak leng bang hong pia tu nu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Amate in ngunn dangka sawmthum la in a sim zawkciang pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hun pan kipan Judas in Jesus a aap thei natu hunpha zong tan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tol saw ngawl anluum poai ni masa ni in nungzuite Jesus kungah hong pai a, “Paisan Poai an koisungah kong vawtsak tu uh ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Khuapi sungah tum tavun a, pasal khat kungah, ‘Syapa in, ka hun hong theng zo hi; ka nungzuite taw Paisan Poai na inn ah vawt tu khu hi,’ ci in son tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nungzuite in Jesus sawl bangin, ngamta uh a, Paisan Poai anneak natu vawtkhol uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nitak ciangin, Jesus le a nungzui sawm le niite an ne tu in to uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anneak laitakin Jesus in, “A maan takin ka ci ciang note sung pan khat in kei hong leeheak tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nungzuite a thin uh nuam ngawl a, khat zawkciang khat in, “Topa, kei hong ci nuam na hi bua na ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ankuang sungah anluum kei taw sawk khawm sia in kei hong leeheak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing Tapa sia Laithiangtho in thi tu hi a ci bangma in thi tu a, ahihang Mihing Tapa a leeheak sia atu in, bangza in lauhuai ziam? Tua pa atu in pian awl zaw le phazaw hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A leeheakpa Judas in, “Syapa, kei hong ci nuam na hi bua na ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Jesus in “Nangma ci bangma ahi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A an neak uh laitakin, Jesus in anluum bek khat la in, lungdamko thungetna a nei zawkciang, baltham in a nungzuite pia hi. “La in ne vun, hisia in ka pumpi ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawkciang hai la in, Pathian tungah lungdamko a, amate pia hi. “Na vekpi in ne vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />hi sia in ka chisan hi a, Pathian thuciamna a kipsak, mihing tam mamate mawna a kimaisak natu a bua ka chisan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kei kong cina pan, ka Pa Ngam sungah note taw sapittui thak ka neak mateng hi sapittui sia ka ne nawn buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate lasa in, Olive Mual zuanin pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaciangin Jesus in amate munah, “Zan ciang tatak ma in no na vekpi in taikeak in kei hong nusia siat tu nu hi, banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, ‘Pathian in tuucingpa thatlum tu a, tuute sia kithethaang tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahihang nuntakna sungah hong kiphokto kik ciangin, note mai Galilee ah ka na paikhol tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Peter in Jesus munah, “A dangte theampo in hong nusia zong, kei kong nusia buatu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesus in Peter munah, “A maan takin kong ci ciang, zan ciang ak khuan ma in thumvei kei nong nial tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Peter in, “Nang taw thi khop tu a kul le zong, tuabangin hong nial ngawl tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi. Nungzui dangte zongh in, tuabang ma in ci tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in a nungzuite taw Gethsemane a kicina mun khat ah pai a, amate munah, “Zia sungah thungen a ka pai lanin hi sungah na to vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in Peter le Zebedee ii tate nii paipui hi. Heena le thinngimna in ama khunel hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />tuaciangin amate munah, “Ka thinngim mama a thi dektak khi hi. Hi sungah na om vun a, mu heak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama sia tawm a pai zawkciang, lei ah bokcip in, thungen hi. “Ka Pa awng, ahithei le hi thuakna hai sia kei tung pan hong laaksak ta'n! Ahihang kei dei bang hi ngawlin, nangma deina bang hi tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, a nungzuite thum kungah heak kik a, amate a mu sa in a om mu hi; tuaciang in Peter munah, “Bangbangin note thum in nai khat sung takpi zongh kei hong ngak zo ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Na na ngak kenkon vun a, ze etna sungah na taaksuk ngawl natu in, thu na ngen vun. Thinsung in uukna nei ahihang, pumpi sia thazawm hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Khatvei ma, Jesus pai in thu ngen hi, “Ka Pa awng, hi hai ka dawn phot ngawl peuma in, hi thuakna hai sia hong kilaaksak ngawl tu ahile nangma deina bang hi tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khatvei ma hong heak kik a, nungzuite sia a mu sa ma in mu leleau hi; amate a mit hak zo mama ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Jesus in amate khatvei nusia kikin, a kammal zak ngei teng ma pau kikin, a thum veina thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua zawkciang nungzuite kungah heak kik a, “Tu dong mu lai in tawlnga lai nu ziam? En vun! Mimawte khut sungah Mihing Tapa a ki aap tu hun hong theng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tho vun, Pai ka tawng. En vun! Kei hong leeheakpa hi sungah om hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesus sia tuabangin a papau laitak, nungzui sawm le nii sungah khat ahi Judas hong theng hi. Namsau le moltawng a toai, thiampi liante le upate ii a sawl mihon khat, ama in hong tonpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ngual leeheakpa in mihonte munah lim khat lak zo hi: “Ka nap tu pa sia na dei uh mihingpa hi tu hi. Man vun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Judas in Jesus kungah tangtan in pai a, “Thupha nga ta'n, Syapa,” ci in namh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesus in zo a, “Na sep tu po seam memeang in, lawm awng!” ci hi. Tua zawkciang amate hong pai in, Jesus man in lencip uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jesus taw omkhawm khat in, a namsau dokin Thiampi Lianbelpa ii salpa saat a, a bil saattan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Jesus in, “Na namsau thun kik in. Namsau a zamhte sia namsau taw ma in thi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“Ka Pa munah hu ngen nuam hi leng ama in vantung ngalkap hon sawm le hon nii sangin a tamzaw thakhat thu in, hong puak tu ahi hunlam he ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ahihang tuabang hi thong le, Laithiangtho in hi teng tung tu hi, a ci sia koibangin tung nawn tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tua zawkciang mipite tungah Jesus in, “Mihing that taiku bangin hong ngaisun a, namsau le moltawng taw kei man tu in hong kuan na hi uh ziam? Ni simin Biakinn sungah to in hilna ka nei lai in, nong man bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ahihang hite theampo sia kamsaangte ii Laithiangtho sung a at teng a taangtun natu ahi hi,” ci hi. Tuaciangin a nungzuite theampo ama nusia in taikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Jesus a mante in Thiampi Lianbelpa Caiaphas inn ah paipui uh a, tua munah Thukham hil Syate le upate kikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Peter in a khuala thithim na panin Thiampi Lianbelpa leitual dong zui hi. Ama sia leitual ah ngalkapte taw tokhawm in bangbangin thu hong piang ziam ci in encik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Thiampi liante le Council bup in Jesus a thalup thei natu in, leilot tetti pawlkhat zon tu in hanciam uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />mihing tam mama hong pai uh a, ama huvau leilot thu tam mama son ahitazong, a mat thei natu thu, bangma a mu bua uh hi. A khakbel ciangin, pasal nii hong ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />“Hisia pa in Pathian ii Biakinn baltham in ni thum sung ka sa kik thei tu ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbelpa hong ding a Jesus munah, “Nang tungah maw hong kisuanhte na zo kik natu he ngawl ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus a huthe bua hi. Khatvei ma Thiampi Lianbelpa in ama tungah, “A nungta Pathian min taw nang sia kiciamna hong vawtsak khi hi: Pathian Tapa Messiah na hi ziam, hong son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />“Nangma ci bang ahi hi. Ahihang na vekpi tungah kong ci hi: tu pan kipan Mihing Tapa sia Vaanglianbelpa ii ziatsang ah to a, van a meeikaai tung pan hong pai na mu tu uh hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Thiampi Lianbelpa in, a puan hong baltham a, “Pathian zawnsakna kampau pa! Tetti dang kul nawn ngawl hi. Pathian min a daisak na sia na zaak tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Bangbang ngaisun tu nu ziam?” ci hi. Amate in, “Ama sia mawnei hi, a thi kul hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in, a maitang cilphii in, saat uh hi; tuaciangin a beangte in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Messiah awng, hong beang sia akua ziam, hong son thei ka sin in,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Peter sia leitual ah to in a om laitak Thiampi Lianbelpa ii naseam numei khat hong pai a, “Nang zongh Galilee mi Jesus taw a kithawl khat hi ngawl ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Ahihang amate theampo ii zaakna ah, ama in nial hi, “Na son thu sia he ngawl khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tuaciangin leitual tumna kongbiang ah pai hi. Naseam numei dang khat ma in mu a, “Ama sia Nazareth khua mi Jesus taw a kithawl khat hi,” ci in mite tungah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Peter in nial leleau a, “Tuasia pa he bong ci in kiciam khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua munah a ding pasal pawlkhat in Peter kung hong zuan a, “Nang zongh ama mite khat ma hi tatak ni hi. Bangpo na ci zong na pau zia in nang sia hong pholaak hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Peter in, “Thumaan son khi hi, ci in kiciam ing! thumaan son ngawl ka hile Pathian in daan hong pia tahen! Mihing ziasia pa he ngawl khi hi!” ci hi. Tua zawk hiat ciangin ak khuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Peter in Jesus ii ama tungah “Ak khuan ma in thumvei hong nial tu ni hi,” ci in a son teng phawk hi. Ama pusuak in nasia takin kap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zingsang tuungin thiampi lian theampo le upate in Jesus a thalup natu vaihawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in Jesus thikkhau taw khi in, paipui a, Romete ii ngamuk mangpa Pilate kungah aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngual leeheakpa Judas in Jesus sia thidaan kipia tu hi, ci in a heak ciangin, ama kisiik kikin, a ngunn dangka sawmthum teng thiampi liante, upate kungah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mihing mawna nei ngawl khat a thi tu in, leeheak ka hikom ka maw zo hi!” ci hi. Amate in, “Tua thu ko taw bang kisai nawn ziam? Tua thu sia nangma taw kisai bek hi!” ci in zo kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judas in a dangka teng Biakinn sungah vawk in nusia a, tua zawkciang ama pusuak in ama le ama awklum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thiampi liante in dangkatangte tawmin, “Hisia in chisan ii man hi a, ih Thukham in chisan man sia Biakinn sumkholna ah khol tu khaam hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate teng tua sum tungtaang ah thukimna a nei zawkciang, Bealseakpa Lo a kici sia, ngamdangmite thaan tu in, tua sum taw lei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hu in tua lo sia “Chisan Lo” tu dong ma in kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kamsaangpa Jeremiah ii sonkhol teng taangtung hi. “Amate in, Israel mite ii ama man tu a, a thukim uh ngunn dangka sawmthum la in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa ii keima hong sawl bangin bealseakpa ii lo sia lei uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus sia Romete ii ngamuk mangpa mai ah ding a, tua pa in, “Nang sia Jew te ii kumpipa na hi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Nangma ci bang ahi hi,” ci in Jesus in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang thiampi liante le upate ii mawsiatnate huvau sia bangma zona a nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Pilate in, “Hi thute taw hong mawsak nate za ngawl ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in kammal khat zongh a zo bua hi, tuasia ciangin ngamuk mangpa in lamdang sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Paisan Poai a tun simin, Romete ngamuk mangpa in mipite ii ngetna bangin, thongtaak khat veu suataksak tu ngeina nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua laitakin Jesus Barabbas a kici a minthang thongtaak pa khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom mipite hong kikhop ciang, Pilate in amate tungah, “Jesus Barabbas hong suatak leng deizaw nu ziam maw, Messiah a kici Jesus hong suatak leng deizaw nu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jew mi thuneite in, Jesus eang ahikom ama ii khut sungah aap ahi hunlam sia Pilate in tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pilate sia thukhenna inn sung a to laitakin a zi in kamtaisak a: “Mawna nei ngawl tua pa tungtaang ah kihel heak in. Tu zan in ama huvau ka mang sungah nasia takin thuak khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thiampi liante le upate in Pilate ii Barabbas suatak a piak natu le, Jesus a thalup tu a nget natu in mipite hol uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang Pilate in mipite munah, “Hite nii sung pan koisia hong tha leng na deizaw uh ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Barabbas,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tua ahile Messiah a kici Jesus sia bang law tu khi ziam?” ci in Pilate in dongh hi. “Thinglamtee tungah thatlum in,” ci tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahizong Pilate in, “Ahihang ama in bang khialna vawt na ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Tuasia ciangin, amate in a aw neiza uh taw au in, “Thinglamtee tungah thatlum in,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pilate in tubang taw kinga zo ngawl tu hi ci a mu ciangin, ngamlumna piang thei tu hi, ci a mu manin tuidam tawm la in, mipite mai ah a khut sil a, “Hisia ii thina taw kisai kei hang hi ngawl hi! Hisia in noma ngamtatna hang ahi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“ama ii thina hangin thuak tu a om babang koma le ka suan ka paalte tungah hong tu tahen!” ci in mipi bup in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Pilate in, amate dei bangin Barabbas tha hi; Jesus sia a velsak zawkciang thinglamtee tungah thalup tu in aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Pilate ii ngalkapte in Jesus sia ngamuk mangpa inn ah paipui uh a, ngalkap hon bup sia ama kim ah kikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in a puansilhte suukeaksak a, puantual san khat silhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua zawkciang lingngui taw kumpilukhu khat vawtin a lu ah khusak hi, tuaciangin ciangkang khat a khut ziatsang ah koi uh a; tua zawkciang a mai ah khupdin in nunau uh hi. “Jew te ii kumpipa a khansau tahen!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in ama cilphii in, a ciangkang sut kik a, a lutang saatna in nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate in a ciammui vawt zazaan zawk uh ciang, a puantual sia suusak kikin, ama ii a silh ngei teng silhsak kik hi. Tua zawkciang thinglamtee tungah thatlum tu in paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate a pusua uh ciang, Cyrene mi Simon a kici khat taw kisi uh a, ngalkapte in zawthawk thu taw Jesus thinglamtee puasak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in Golgotha a kici “Lungu Mun” theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua munah amate in sapittui le tuikhaa nam khat hel in, Jesus pia uh hi; ahihang ama in tep bek in a ne bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in Jesus sia thinglamtee tungah kilh uh a, nuangtang lotna taw in a puan teng hawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua munah to in ama en uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A lu tung san ah ama kimawsakna laimal teng taak uh hi. “Hisia in Jesus hi. Jew te Kumpipa hi,” ci in at uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin phalakte nii zongh Jesus ziatsang ah khat veisang ah khat khaikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua mun kaantan a hong pai mihingte in Jesus sia lupei sanin nunau zazaan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Biakinn baltham in ni thum zawkciang a sa kik tu pa, Pathian Tapa na hile, nangma le nangma kihun in! Thinglamtee tung pan hong tuaksuk ta'n,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuabang tatak ma in thiampi liante, Thukham hil syate le upate in selno uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Ngualdangte hun zo ahihang ama le ama kihun thei ngawl hi. Ama sia Israel te Kumpipa hi ka na ngawl ziam! Thinglamtee tung pan hong tuaksuk le, tuasia ciang ama ki um tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in Pathian muang a, Pathian Tapa ka hi ci hi. Tua ahile Pathian in tu in a hunnuam ziam en tawng!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Thinglamtee tungah ama bangin a kikhai phalakte ngawngawn in, ama sia tuabang ma in selno uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nisun ciangin ngam bup sia khuazing in siin cip a, nai thum sung khuazing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nai thum saat tu bang ciangin Jesus in aw nging tatak taw, “Eli, Eli, lema sabachthani?” ci in au hi. A khiakna sia “Ka Pathian, Ka Pathian awng! Banghang hong nusia ni ziam?” a cina hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua munah a ding mihing pawlkhatte in za a, “Ama in Elijah sam hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amate sung pan khat tai in, sapittui haau sungah puansia pap in, ciangkang tungah sawm in a neak tu in, ama kam ah taa to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahihang pawlkhatte in, “Ngak vun! Elijah in ama hun tu in hong pai ziam, en tawng!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus a nging takin a au kik zawkciang a hui tat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuaciangin Biakinn sungah kidalna puan a kikhai sia a lu pan a taw dong khen nii in kizensuk hi. Zinliing a suangpite kikhentham in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />thaante kihong in, Pathian ii mihing a thisate tam ma kitho kiksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Amate in thaan nusia in, Jesus ii thina pan a thaw kik zawkciang, Khuapi Thiangtho sungah tum uh a, tua munah mihing tam mama in amate mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ngalkap hon ukpa le Jesus a cing ngalkapte in zinliing le thupiang dang theampo a mu uh ciang, lau mama a, “Ama sia Pathian Tapa tatak hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Galilee pan a zui, ama a hu numei tam mamate a khuala na ah ding in Jesus en uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tuate sungah Mary Magdalene, James le Joseph nu Mary, Zebedee ii zi kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Nitak ciangin, Arimathea panin sumhau khat hong theng hi. A min Joseph hi a, ama zongh Jesus ii nungzui khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ama in Pilate omna ah pai in Jesus luang ngen hi. Pilate in Jesus luang sia Joseph piak natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tua ahikom Joseph in la a, puanneal kaang thak taw a tun zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />ama ii thaankuul sungah koi hi. Tua thaankuul sia suangpi a khuak thak ahi hi. Tua zawkciang, ama in suangtumpui khat thaan kuavang mai ah liik in a kha zawkciang cia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Mary Magdalene le Mary dang khat sia thaan maingat in to uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />A khuavak ni sia Sabbath ni hi a, thiampi liante le Pharisee te in Pilate taw kimu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />“Topa awng, mihing leilot pa in a nuntak lai in, ‘Ni thum zawkciang, nuntakna sungah hong kitho kiksak tu hi,’ a ci ngei sia ka phawk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />A nungzuite hong pai in, a luang ngu a, mihingte munah thina pan thosak zo hi a ci thei ngawl natu in, a ni thum ni ciang dong thaan sia pha takpi a kicin natu thupia in. A leilot thu son khak zaw sia in, a masa sia sangin sia zawlai tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Pilate in, “Ngalkap pawlkhat paipui vun a, thaan sia a muanhuai theiza in cingsak tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate pai in, thaan kongvang sia a bit thei natu in, suang tungah tepteena khen in ngalkapte ii cin tu in nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabbath zawkciang, Nipi ni khua hong vak ciangin, Mary Magdalene le Mary dangkhat thaan vil tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thakhatin nasia tak zinliing hi. Topa vantunglalang khat van pan hong tuaksuk a, thaan kong hukna suangtum liikkeak in a tungah to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama meal sia khualeng taw kibangin, a puansilh sia vuuk bangin paak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A cingte lau mama ahikom, liingin mithi sate taw kibang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vantunglalang in numeite paupui hi. “Lau heak vun. Thinglamtee tungah a kithat Jesus sia zong nu hi ci in kong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in hi sungah om ngawl hi! Ama hong sonsa bangma in kitho kiksak zo hi. Hi sungah hong pai tavun a, a lupna hong en tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu in manlangin pai tavun a, a nungzuite munah, ‘Ama sia thina pan kithosak zo a, tu in ama in note mai Galilee ah pai tu hi; tua munah ama na mu tu uh hi!’ ci tavun. Kong son sate ciamtee tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in, thaan sia manlang takin nusia a, lau kawm si lungdamna taw kidim si in, nungzuite kungah thupuak tu in tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thakhatin Jesus in amate taw kisi a, “Thinnopna na nga tavun,” ci hi. Amate in ama kungah hong neak uh a, a peang koai in bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesus in, “Lau heak vun; Pai tavun a, ka suapuite tungah, Galilee ah pai tu in sawl tavun, tua munah amate in kei hong mu tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numeite sia amate pai natu ah a pai laanin, thaancing ngalkapte pawlkhat khuapi sungah heak kikin, thiampi liante tungah thupiang theampo ko uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thiampi liante in upate taw kisi in, kikupna khat nei uh hi. A ngalkapte sum tam mama pia uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuaciangin, “Zan ka mut lanin nungzuite hong pai a, a luang hong ngu hi, na ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciangin ngamuk mangpa in hi thu a za tha le, note mawna a hi ngawl hunlam ka na son tu uh hi, bangma thinngim natu om ngawl hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngalkapte in sum la in, a kisawl na bangin vawt uh hi. Tua hi a, tua thupuakna sia tuni dong Jew te sungah kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nungzui sawm le khat te in Galilee ngam mual tungah Jesus sawl bangin pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama a mu ciangin, pawlkhat in um tak ngawl ahitazong, amate in bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesus in amate kung nai neakin, “Vantung le leitung ah thunei theina theampo a vekpi in kei hong kipia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahiciang pai tavun, mun theampo ah mihing theampo ka nungzui suaksak tavun: Pa, Tapa le Thaa Thiangtho min taw tui na phum tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaciang ka thu piakte theampo a zui natu hil tavun. Tuaciang hun bo dongin note taw kong omkhawm tawntung tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
